                                                 |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `c` / `cpp` | 源码 + `fuyubot_plugin.h`（从 `PLUGIN_HEADER` 落的盘，唯一权威源） |","table":"table-0"},"12":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-10","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#init","content":"| 语言       | 生成什么                                                                       |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `python` | `src/lib.rs`（`script_plugin!`）+ `plugin.py` + `fuyubot_plugin.py`(+`.pyi`) |","table":"table-0"},"13":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-11","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#init","content":"| 语言   | 生成什么                                                       |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `js` | `src/lib.rs` + `plugin.js` + `fuyubot_plugin.js`(+`.d.ts`) |","table":"table-0"},"14":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-12","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#init","content":"生成的 Rust 插件默认写 `fuyubot-plugin-api = \"0.1.0\"`（crates.io）。想对着 SDK 源码开发就设\n`FUYUBOT_SDK_PATH` 指向 SDK 仓库里放着 crate 的目录（`crates/`），生成器会改写成 `path = …`；\n没设且本地找不到源码时只写版本号。"},"15":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-13","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#codegen","content":"刷新某门语言的 ABI 绑定文件到 `<dir>`：C / C++ 是 `fuyubot_plugin.h`，Python 是\n`fuyubot_plugin.py` + `.pyi`，JS 是 `fuyubot_plugin.js` + `.d.ts`。**会覆盖同名文件**。\n所有语言都来自同一份权威源（`fuyubot_abi::PLUGIN_HEADER` 与 `fuyubot-sdk-script` 里的桥），\n不是手抄的第二份。`--lang rust` 没有可生成的绑定，命令会说明。"},"16":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-14","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#check","content":"**静态**读 PE / ELF / Mach-O 的导出表（用 `object`，**绝不 dlopen**——加载会在宿主进程里跑插件的\n初始化代码，那已经算「运行」了）。非零退出码 = 宿主会拒绝加载（缺 `plugin_init`，或根本不是动态库）。"},"17":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-15","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#check","content":"`check` 静态看不到 `PluginHandle.abi_version`——版本是 `plugin_init` 的**返回值**，不是静态符号。\n它只会如实报「宿主是 vN，插件的版本只能运行时判定」，**别把它当兼容性结论**。"},"18":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-16","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#abi-version--td-methods--td-method","content":"`td-methods` / `td-method` 吃的是**编译期**烤进二进制的真 `td_api.tl` 元数据（`TdApiSchema::compiled()`），\n不读文件、不联网。`--filter` 是子串匹配、忽略大小写；构造器不能当方法调，`td-method` 会明确拒绝。"},"19":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-17","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#abi-version--td-methods--td-method","content":"TDLib 的方法名 ≠ Telegram Bot API 的：所有发送都是 `sendMessage` + `input_message_content`，\n`sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` 之类在 TDLib 里不存在。写请求前先用 `td-method` 核一遍。"},"20":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-18","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#相关页面","content":"各语言怎么写：插件总览"},"21":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-19","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#相关页面","content":"装进插件目录：调试与安装"},"22":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk-20","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk#相关页面","content":"环境变量（`FUYUBOT_SDK_PATH`）：环境变量"},"23":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"page","content":"fuyubot 命令参考","breadcrumbs":["Docs","CLI 文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot"},"24":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-0","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","content":"运行时 CLI：init / run / status / stop / config / plugin"},"25":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-1","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"`init`"},"26":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-2","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"`run`"},"27":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-3","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#status--stop","content":"`status` / `stop`"},"28":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-4","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"`config`"},"29":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-5","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"`plugin`"},"30":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-6","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"相关页面"},"31":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-7","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","content":"跑框架的那个 CLI。它就是运行时包里的 `fuyubot(.exe)`（从源码跑时是 `target/{debug,release}/fuyubot`）。"},"32":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-8","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"| 参数      | 默认  | 说明                                              |\n| ------- | --- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `--dir` | `.` | 项目目录，生成 `<dir>/fuyubot.toml` 与 `<dir>/plugins/` |","table":"table-0"},"33":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-9","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"| 参数       | 默认        | 说明             |\n| -------- | --------- | -------------- |\n| `--name` | `fuyubot` | 只影响配置里的 `name` |","table":"table-0"},"34":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-10","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"| 参数         | 默认  | 说明                                          |\n| ---------- | --- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `--api-id` | `0` | TDLib api_id（不是秘密，可以写进配置）；`0` = 没配，`run` 会问 |","table":"table-0"},"35":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-11","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#init","content":"`init` **只写 `api_id`**：`api_hash` 这个命令连参数都不收（init 阶段手上不该有它）——`run` 首次会问，问完写回配置。\n重复 `init` 会被挡住（不覆盖你改过的配置）。"},"36":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-12","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数         | 作用                                              |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `--config` | 配置文件，默认 `fuyubot.toml`（缺这个文件时 `run` 会按模板自动生成一份） |","table":"table-1"},"37":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-13","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数             | 作用                 |\n| -------------- | ------------------ |\n| `--plugin-dir` | 覆盖 `[plugins].dir` |","table":"table-1"},"38":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-14","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数           | 作用             |\n| ------------ | -------------- |\n| `--no-tdlib` | 不接 TDLib，只加载插件 |","table":"table-1"},"39":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-15","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数           | 作用                                        |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `--no-login` | 接 TDLib 但不走登录流程（已有 session 照样能用；CI / 容器用） |","table":"table-1"},"40":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-16","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数             | 作用                                                       |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--background` | 派生无终端的子进程，stdout/stderr 进 `logs/fuyubot.log`，父进程等状态发布后返回 |","table":"table-1"},"41":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-17","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数              | 作用                                   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `--replay <文件>` | 把一批更新 JSON 灌进管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号** |","table":"table-1"},"42":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-18","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"| 参数                   | 作用                                      |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `--replay-wait <MS>` | 回放后等插件的静默窗口；不填按插件形态自选（脚本插件 2000，原生 150） |","table":"table-1"},"43":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-19","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"`run` 不带 `--replay` 的顺序：自动 init → 拿单实例锁 → 问/读凭据 → attach TDLib → 加载全部插件 →\n发 `setTdlibParameters` 并登录 → `getMe` 打印账户 → 发布状态 → 才开始分发。\n**登录这一步没有真账号端到端验过**，要立刻验插件就用 `--replay`。"},"44":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-20","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#run","content":"后台运行**没有 stdin**：没有 session 又没有 `TG_BOT_TOKEN` 时会直接失败并把日志尾巴打出来——\n先用前台登录一次（session 落在 `data/`）。"},"45":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-21","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#status--stop","content":"`status` 只读 `<项目根>/.fuyubot/`，三态：运行中 / 启动中 / 没有运行中的实例（顺带报「上次」的 pid）。\n`stop` 是**优雅**的：写 `.fuyubot/stop` 请实例自己收摊（停接收循环 → 卸载插件 → 停内核 → 放锁），\n8 秒不理会才硬杀。"},"46":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-22","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"打印**生效值**：默认值填好之后每一项到底是什么，外加「向上找到的那份 `fuyubot.toml`」。\n不加载插件、不接 TDLib、不建任何东西。"},"47":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-23","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"文件不存在时第一行会写「（不存在，下面全是默认值）」——`run` 就是这样起的，不骗人。"},"48":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-24","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"`account_type` 写错**不会**静默当 bot：那一行直接是 `⚠️ [telegram].account_type = \"robot\" 认不出来，只能写 \"bot\" 或 \"user\"`。"},"49":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-25","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"每个 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 段各占一行（插件名是点分的，所以显示成 `[plugin.fuyubot.manage]`）；没有插件段时写「无（没有 `[plugin.*]` 段）」。"},"50":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-26","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#config","content":"没有 `get` / `set` / `path`：改配置用编辑器更直接，路径 `status` 第一行已经打了。**插件**读写配置走 ABI 的 `get_config` / `set_config`（见插件 ABI），不是这个子命令。"},"51":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-27","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"| 命令                                                     | 作用                    |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin list [--config …] [--plugin-dir <目录>]` | 列出插件；脚本插件会**展平到每个脚本** |","table":"table-2"},"52":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-28","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"| 命令                                                                | 作用                              |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin install <文件或目录> [--config …] [--plugin-dir <目录>]` | 装一个插件：传**目录**是脚本插件，传**文件**是原生插件 |","table":"table-2"},"53":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-29","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"| 命令                                                               | 作用                        |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin uninstall <名字> [--config …] [--plugin-dir <目录>]` | 卸载：脚本插件按**目录名**，原生插件按动态库名 |","table":"table-2"},"54":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-30","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"**脚本插件**（推荐，见 脚本插件）：传的是**整个目录**\n（里面有 `pyproject.toml` / `package.json` 身份段），装到 `plugins/scripts/<目录名>/`。\n目标已存在会报错，要覆盖先 `uninstall` 再 `install`。"},"55":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-31","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"**原生插件**：传编好的 `.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`，或**工程目录**（去\n`<工程>/target/{release,debug}` 找产物）。产物连同旁边 / 工程根的 `.py` / `.js` /\n`.ts` / `.pyi` 同伴脚本一起拷进插件目录。workspace 成员的产物默认落在仓库根\n`target/` 下，这种情况加 `--target-dir` 或直接指着产物装。"},"56":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-32","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"`list` 会**真的加载一次**动态库才知道名字，但**只发现不启动**脚本——不装依赖、\n不起进程，随时可以跑。脚本的名字取自 manifest（`name` 字段），路径是入口文件。"},"57":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-33","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#plugin","content":"`uninstall` 对**跑着的实例也安全**：文件删掉后目录 watch 会自动卸载对应脚本，\n不需要先 `stop`。"},"58":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-34","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"脚本插件上手：脚本插件"},"59":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-35","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"配置字段：配置文件"},"60":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-36","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"实例与后台运行：运行与实例管理"},"61":{"id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot-37","page_id":"/docs/cli/fuyubot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli/fuyubot#相关页面","content":"回放的输出与等待窗口：离线回放"},"62":{"id":"/docs/cli","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"page","content":"CLI 总览","breadcrumbs":["Docs","CLI 文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli"},"63":{"id":"/docs/cli-0","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"两个 CLI 的分工、共同约定与命令速查"},"64":{"id":"/docs/cli-1","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"共同约定"},"65":{"id":"/docs/cli-2","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#命令速查","content":"命令速查"},"66":{"id":"/docs/cli-3","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"fuyubot 有两个命令行程序，职责严格分离，**都不编译、不打包插件**——编译归插件作者自己的工具链\n（`cargo build`、`cl /LD`、`gcc -shared`）。"},"67":{"id":"/docs/cli-4","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"| CLI       | 干什么                                                          | 二进制             |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------- |\n| `fuyubot` | 跑框架：`init` / `run` / `status` / `stop` / `config` / `plugin` | `fuyubot(.exe)` |","table":"table-0"},"68":{"id":"/docs/cli-5","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"| CLI           | 干什么                                | 二进制                 |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-sdk` | 写插件：脚手架 / 生成绑定 / 查 TDLib 方法 / 静态检查 | `fuyubot-sdk(.exe)` |","table":"table-0"},"69":{"id":"/docs/cli-6","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"`fuyubot` 在运行时仓库的包里（旁边带着 `tdjson` 和内置插件目录 `plugins/`），`fuyubot-sdk` 在\nFuyuBot-SDK 的\n`fuyubot-sdk-<系统>-<架构>.zip` 里（不需要 `tdjson`）。从源码跑的等价写法是把子命令接在 `--` 之后："},"70":{"id":"/docs/cli-7","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项               | 约定                                                                   |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--config <文件>` | 默认 `fuyubot.toml`；项目根 = 配置文件所在目录，`plugins/`、`data/`、`.fuyubot/` 都相对它 |","table":"table-1"},"71":{"id":"/docs/cli-8","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项                   | 约定                     |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖配置里的 `[plugins].dir` |","table":"table-1"},"72":{"id":"/docs/cli-9","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项   | 约定                                             |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 退出码 | `0` 成功；非零是失败（`fuyubot-sdk check` 非零 = 宿主会拒绝加载） |","table":"table-1"},"73":{"id":"/docs/cli-10","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项   | 约定                                                                           |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 凭据  | **只走环境变量或交互式输入**，任何命令都不把它们写进文件（`TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH` / `TG_BOT_TOKEN`） |","table":"table-1"},"74":{"id":"/docs/cli-11","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#共同约定","content":"| 项    | 约定                                             |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 输出语言 | 中文；`status` / `stop` 是给人看的，不要拿去解析（没有 `--json`） |","table":"table-1"},"75":{"id":"/docs/cli-12","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令速查","content":"<Card title=\"fuyubot 命令参考\" href=\"/docs/cli/fuyubot/\" />"},"76":{"id":"/docs/cli-13","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#命令速查","content":"<Card title=\"fuyubot-sdk 命令参考\" href=\"/docs/cli/fuyubot-sdk/\" />"},"77":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"page","content":"架构与数据流","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture"},"78":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture","content":"一个宿主进程 + N 个动态库插件，以及它们之间的三段数据流"},"79":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"crate 依赖方向"},"80":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"启动顺序：先 attach TDLib，再 load 插件"},"81":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"主链路"},"82":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"注册作用域与卸载"},"83":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"两种插件形态"},"84":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"四大机制与内核"},"85":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"绑定层与运行时（`fuyubot-tdlib-sys` / `fuyubot-tdlib`）"},"86":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"`td_api.tl` 转成了什么（**只在编译期**）"},"87":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"关键类型对照"},"88":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture","content":"结论先说：**一个宿主进程 + N 个动态库插件（cdylib）**。插件不认识 Rust，只认识 `HostApiVTable`；\n宿主是**唯一**实现这张表的 crate（`fuyubot-loader`）。脚本插件（Python / JS / TS）不改变这个结构\n——目录形态由两个中间插件（`fuyubot_python_host` / `fuyubot_js_host`）托管，旧的胶水形态\n则把解释器子进程藏在自己的 cdylib 里。"},"89":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture","content":"本文只讲**结构与数据流**；构建、发布与排错见 开发文档。"},"90":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"箭头指向「依赖的那一边」（`A --> B` = A 依赖 B）："},"91":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                | 允许吗 |\n| -------------------------------- | --- |\n| `fuyubot-core` → `fuyubot-tdlib` | 禁止  |","table":"table-0"},"92":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                              | 允许吗 |\n| ------------------------------ | --- |\n| `fuyubot-abi` → `fuyubot-core` | 禁止  |","table":"table-0"},"93":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                                | 允许吗       |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | --------- |\n| `event` / `service` / `tool` / `middleware` 互相依赖 | 禁止（彼此不依赖） |","table":"table-0"},"94":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                   | 允许吗       |\n| ----------------------------------- | --------- |\n| `fuyubot-tdlib-sys` → 任何 fuyu crate | 禁止（它是最底层） |","table":"table-0"},"95":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"| 边                                                  | 允许吗         |\n| -------------------------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| `fuyubot-loader` → 四个机制 + `tdlib` + `abi` + `core` | 允许（**只有它**） |","table":"table-0"},"96":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#crate-依赖方向","content":"组合只发生在两处：`HostRuntime::new`（把四个机制 `install` 进 `Context`）与 `HostRuntime` 里的\n17 个 `unsafe extern \"C\"` 桥。四个机制 crate 绝不彼此调用。"},"97":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#启动顺序先-attach-tdlib再-load-插件","content":"为什么不能反过来：`attach_tdlib` 之前 `td_send` 走「没接 TDLib」分支（请求只留档 + 合成请求号，\n起点 `1 << 48`），而插件在 `plugin_start` 里就发请求（模板与示例都这样）；分发排在插件加载之后，\n否则插件漏订阅。`--replay` / `--no-tdlib` 故意不 attach——回放是离线验证。"},"98":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"`process`（吃 `&str`）只是 `process_value` 的前半段（解析 JSON 再交给它）；接收循环那条路\n本来就有 `Value`，所以走 `process_value`。"},"99":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"| 阶段                                                            | 数值            | 谁跑它                             |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `Stage::PreUpdate` / `PreRoute` / `InPlugin` / `PostResponse` | 0 / 1 / 2 / 3 | `UpdatePipeline::process_value` |","table":"table-1"},"100":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"| 阶段                                    | 数值    | 谁跑它                                          |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `Stage::PreToolCall` / `PostToolCall` | 4 / 5 | **目前没有生产调用方**（只有 `fuyubot-middleware` 自己的测试） |","table":"table-1"},"101":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-23","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"六阶段的数值在 `fuyubot-abi::Stage`，与 `fuyubot-middleware::Stage` 一一对应，由 `runtime.rs` 的\n`stage_numbers_match_the_middleware_crate` 测试钉住。"},"102":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-24","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"三条容易搞错的语义："},"103":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-25","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**归属是「额外定向」，不是「排除广播」**：`emit` 发给所有订阅者，`emit_scoped(owner, …)` 是\n「全局 + 该归属」。响应因此对所有插件透明。"},"104":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-26","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**中间件一条更新跑一遍，不是每个监听器跑一遍**：`InPlugin` 的产出就是所有监听器看到的版本\n（按监听器各跑一遍的话，第 N 个会看到被改过 N 次的 payload）。"},"105":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-27","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**过滤器里的 `event_type` 键只用来选通道**，不参与负载匹配；等响应写\n`{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":N}`。"},"106":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-28","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"`HostRuntime::plugin_scope()` 给这次加载分配一个 owner id，之后所有跨 ABI 的注册\n（订阅 / 工具 / 服务 / 中间件）都记在这个 owner 名下（`RegistrationKind` + `Registration`）。\n`scope.commit()` 保留；提前 drop（init 失败、start 报错、ABI 不匹配）或 `LoadedPlugin` 被 drop 时，\n`rollback_owner(owner)` 一次性撤掉这批注册；宿主自己（owner 0）不受影响。"},"107":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-29","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"`LoadedPlugin` 的字段声明顺序就是卸载顺序：先 `plugin_stop`，再 `rollback_owner`，\n最后 `_lib: Library` 才 drop——到这一步动态库才真正卸载。"},"108":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-30","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"中间插件要批量托管脚本时，用**内置 scope 服务**（`get_service(\"fuyubot.host.scope\")`）开子作用域：\n`create` 出的子作用域从当前作用域栈继承 owner（脱离加载线程的场景——比如 watch 线程——要先建\nroot scope 再 `enter`，否则 owner 退化成宿主 0，卸载时回滚不到），注册落在子作用域里，\n`rollback_scope` 可以只撤这一批；插件卸载时连 owner 一起收。"},"109":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-31","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"**唯一的例外是 Go 的 c-shared 库**：它的运行时有线程与信号处理器，卸载后进程会 access violation\n（`0xC0000005`，而且崩在退出那一刻）。`PluginLoader` 用文件里的 Go buildinfo 魔数认出 Go 产物，\n对这类库 `plugin_stop` 与注册回滚照跑，但**故意不卸载那个 `Library`**，让它映射到进程退出。\n代价是「同一进程内反复加载同一个 Go 插件」不可靠（热重载路径），收益是 Go 插件能正常用。"},"110":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-32","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|         | 动态库插件             | 脚本插件（目录形态）    |\n| ------- | ----------------- | ------------- |\n| 进程 / 边界 | 与宿主同进程；C ABI 函数调用 | 一进程一脚本；经原生桥回调 |","table":"table-2"},"111":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-33","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|      | 动态库插件 | 脚本插件（目录形态）                                   |\n| ---- | ----- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本定位 | 不适用   | manifest（`[tool.fuyubot]` / `\"fuyubot\"`）声明入口 |","table":"table-2"},"112":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-34","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|     | 动态库插件                 | 脚本插件（目录形态）                                 |\n| --- | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 装载  | `plugin install <产物>` | `plugin install <目录>` → `plugins/scripts/` |","table":"table-2"},"113":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-35","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|           | 动态库插件     | 脚本插件（目录形态）                    |\n| --------- | --------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 启动时序 / 崩溃 | 同步；崩了拖垮宿主 | 装依赖后起进程，等 `ready`；子进程死，宿主记一条错 |","table":"table-2"},"114":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-36","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|       | 动态库插件                                  | 脚本插件（目录形态）           |\n| ----- | -------------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| 已知天花板 | panic 靠 `C-unwind` + `catch_unwind` 接住 | 改代码不热载（watch 只认目录增删） |","table":"table-2"},"115":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-37","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"脚本侧（薄 SDK 与目录形态）见文档站的\n脚本插件。\n两门语言的中间插件是同一套机制的两份实现，所以「Python SDK 与 JS SDK 对 ABI 的理解」不可能漂移。"},"116":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-38","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"共用的三条约定：**回调错误类型由 core 定**（四个 crate 不能互相依赖，所以 `fuyubot_core::Result<T>`\n是全仓唯一允许 boxed error 的地方）；**与 Context 的集成 = `install(ctx)` + 扩展 trait**\n（返回的 `Effect` 要一直持有，否则服务立刻从 Context 消失）；**所有注册都返回句柄且 `#[must_use]`**\n（四个 Handle 内部都包着 `core::Effect`，drop 即回滚）。"},"117":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-39","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**事件**：`emit` 在锁**外面**调回调，所以回调里再 `on` / `emit` / `off` 不会自锁；某个回调返回\n`Err` 会**中断**本次广播并把错误抛出去。`Filter` 用点分路径（`\"message.chat.id\"`）做字段相等匹配。"},"118":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-40","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**服务**：命名容器（跨语言插件报不出 Rust 的 `TypeId`）。同名重复注册报错；`get::<T>` 类型不匹配\n返回 `None`，用 `contains` + `type_of` 区分「没注册」和「类型不对」。"},"119":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-41","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**工具**：`call_tool` = 查表 → 权限门 → input_schema → 处理器 → output_schema。\n`handler: Option<ToolHandlerFn>`，`None` 表示「只有元数据的声明型工具」；注册/注销用 `on_change`\n广播（**不认识事件系统**，要不要转成事件总线由宿主层做）。"},"120":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-42","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**中间件**：洋葱模型，`next.run(ctx)` 前是进入段、后是退出段。`run(stage, ctx)` 会**先复制层列表\n再执行**，所以中间件里再 `use_middleware` 不会自锁；不调 `next.run` 就是不往下走。"},"121":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-43","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"内核几条语义：**`Context` 只有 `&self`**（`provide` 返回 `Effect`，drop 即注销，必须持有）；\n**`Effect::merge` 是 LIFO**（`a.merge(b)` 撤销顺序 `b → a`）；**加载顺序由依赖决定，卸载是加载顺序\n的倒序**（`load_all` 报错会把本次已加载的卸掉，不留半加载）；**有依赖者时 `unload` 拒绝**\n（`HasDependents`，不级联）；`reload` 能工作是因为管理器存的是 `Arc<dyn Plugin>` 而不是 `Box`。"},"122":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-44","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"`fuyubot_tdlib::` 根上重导出 sys 的 `ffi` / `schema` / `td_api` / `tl_schema` 模块与 `TdApiSchema` /\n`EntryKind` / `TlEntry` / `TlParam` / `SchemaError` / `TdApi` / `DEFAULT_LOG_VERBOSITY`——**既有调用方的\n路径全部不变**。`src/build_support.rs` 与 `src/loader/vendored.rs` 都被**两边共用**（各自的 build.rs 用\n`#[path]` 引同一份源码），所以它们只能依赖 std 与可选依赖；`[package.metadata.fuyubot]` 有两份，值必须\n一致（守卫测试 `metadata_is_in_sync_between_the_two_crates`）。"},"123":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-45","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"运行时加载优先级（`loader::resolve`）：`TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH` 文件/目录 → **vendored 目录 →\n可执行文件所在目录（ExeDir）** → Linux 带版本号系统库 → 裸库名（真去 dlopen 试一次）；全失败返回\n`TdlibLoadError::NotFound`，消息里逐条列出 `[1]`…`[4]` 的尝试与原因。真正加载走\n`loader::open_library`（Windows 绝对路径走 `LOAD_WITH_ALTERED_SEARCH_PATH`），**不是 `Library::new`**\n——新增任何加载动态库的地方都走它。`@extra` 是**字符串**（`RequestId::to_extra()`），`route()`\n遇到非数字 `@extra` 会退化成更新而不是 panic。"},"124":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-46","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"两份产物来自同一个解析结果，而且 `tl_schema.rs` 被 build.rs 用 `#[path]` 引同一份实现，所以「编译期\n写出来的形状」与「运行时读回去的形状」不可能漂移。生成规则：类 → 带 `#[serde(tag = \"@type\")]` 的 enum；\n函数 → 带 `METHOD` / `RESULT` 常量的 struct（派生 `Default`，没填的字段不写进请求）；类字段一律\n`Option<Box<T>>`（断互递归 + 对上「缺字段就是没有」）；认不出的类型降级成 `serde_json::Value`；Rust\n关键字转义（`r#type`）；**文档四级齐全**（类 / 变体 / 函数 / 字段）。归类只认\n`---functions---` / `---types---` 分区标记，认不出来时**构建直接失败**。\n`check_request` 那套元数据仍然保留——它做的是生成类型做不到的本地校验（生成类型只能保证**结构**对，\n挡不住「用错方法名」）。"},"125":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-47","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                                      | 位置            | 作用                                                               |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `HostApiVTable` / `PluginHandle` / `HostApi` | `fuyubot-abi` | 函数表（20 字段） / `plugin_init` 的返回值（`abi_version == 0` = 失败） / 插件侧门面 |","table":"table-3"},"126":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-48","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                                                            | 位置               | 作用                                                                              |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `HostRuntime` / `UpdatePipeline` / `PluginLoader` / `LoadedPlugin` | `fuyubot-loader` | 17 个桥的落点、请求留档、响应回投、`rollback_owner`、全局配置读写；六阶段（实跑 4 个）+ 双通道路由；dlopen 与 drop 即卸载 |","table":"table-3"},"127":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-49","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                               | 位置              | 作用                                                                                  |\n| ------------------------------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `TdClient` / `Routed` / `ReceiveLoop` | `fuyubot-tdlib` | TDLib 客户端；`route()` 分出 `Update` / `Response`；停止把手（`stop()` / `join()`，drop **不会**停） |","table":"table-3"},"128":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-50","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                    | 位置                 | 作用                                                                                                    |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify` / `RichMessage` | `fuyubot-simplify` | 发消息 / 相册 / 编辑 / 删除 / Markdown 转 entities / 等响应 / **富消息**（`rich` 模块，本地 Markdown → 块树）；参数是**每个方法一个结构体** |","table":"table-3"},"129":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-51","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                   | 位置                  | 作用                                     |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `TdApiSchema::compiled()` | `fuyubot-tdlib-sys` | 编译期烘焙的元数据；`check_request` 做本地方法名/参数名校验 |","table":"table-3"},"130":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"page","content":"构建与测试","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test"},"131":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test","content":"三条硬门槛、两类测试，以及本机的离线约定"},"132":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"三条硬门槛"},"133":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"构建输入与缓存"},"134":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"两类测试"},"135":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"测试写法的三条规矩"},"136":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#本机的离线约定","content":"本机的离线约定"},"137":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"⚠️ 三条都带 `--workspace`：根 `Cargo.toml` 有 `default-members = [\"crates/*\"]`，\n**裸** `cargo build` / `cargo test` 只编 `crates/`，不编 `examples/`。\n`#[allow]` 不算消 warning——能改就改。"},"138":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"`cargo tree --workspace --offline` 必须无环；依赖方向随时能用\n`cargo tree -p <crate> -e normal --depth 1` 验。"},"139":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**，`fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs` 无条件去拿它："},"140":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"缓存根按顺序找（`build_support::cache_roots()`，两个 build.rs 共用同一串）："},"141":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已把第三档指好（`relative = true`，相对仓库根），克隆下来直接能用。"},"142":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"**手写必须绝对路径**：两个 build.rs 的 CWD 是各自的 crate 根，相对路径会解析到 crate 下面然后 404。"},"143":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`$OUT_DIR` 每次重跑构建脚本都会被清空 → 退到它意味着下次**重新下载**，缓存根全写不进去时会明确警告。"},"144":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"转换在编译期完成：日志里只有一条 `已转换 …\\td_api.tl：共 N 条`。条数取决于那份文件，**别当常量写进断言**。"},"145":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`.cargo/config.toml` 另有三个别名：`cargo bot`（= `fuyubot run`）、`cargo package-bot`、\n`cargo package-sdk`（release 构建，产物在 `target/release/`，tdjson 由 build.rs 放到 exe 同级）。"},"146":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"**默认自检不碰任何外部文件**：真 tdjson、真 `td_api.tl`（用 `TDLIB_TD_API_TL` 顶替时）、真 Releases 下载\n全部藏在 `#[ignore]` 后面。所以「全绿」只证明代码自洽——**与真实 TDLib 对不对得上只有那些\n`--ignored` 能回答**："},"147":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"改 `ffi.rs` 的符号名/arity、`loader::open_library`（或任何加载动态库的地方）、\n`tl_schema` / `tl_codegen`，或碰登录/授权代码之后，**必须**跑一次。\n`--features vendored` 那条（会尝试访问 Releases，失败只警告）在动 build 脚本 / 资产表时也要跑。"},"148":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"**临时目录不许用 `%TEMP%`**：一律 `target/test-tmp/<crate>/<名字>`。MSYS 会把 `TEMP` 改成 `/tmp`，\n受限环境里真实 `%TEMP%` 也可能写不了——换个 shell 就红的测试几乎总是这个原因。"},"149":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"**嵌套调用 cargo / 编译器时**，把子进程的 `TEMP`/`TMP` 也指到那里：MSVC 的 `link.exe`\n建不了 `%TEMP%` 里的 `lnk*.tmp`，直接 `LNK1104`，插件/夹具根本编不出来。"},"150":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"非平凡逻辑留**一个**可运行自检：`#[cfg(test)]` 里一个 `assert` 测试即可，不引测试框架。"},"151":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#本机的离线约定","content":"DSH 沙箱里 cargo 的 TLS 连不上 crates.io（`schannel … SEC_E_NO_CREDENTIALS`）。\n`Cargo.lock` 已落盘，`--offline` 就够；**只有改依赖版本时**才需要联网，那时向用户申请一次完整权限跑\n`cargo fetch`。"},"152":{"id":"/docs/dev","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"page","content":"开发文档","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev"},"153":{"id":"/docs/dev-0","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"改框架本身：结构、构建测试、踩过的坑、发布"},"154":{"id":"/docs/dev-1","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"本节的页面"},"155":{"id":"/docs/dev-2","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev#一分钟上手","content":"一分钟上手"},"156":{"id":"/docs/dev-3","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"这一节是给**改 fuyubot 仓库**的人看的，不是给用它写 bot 的人看的。"},"157":{"id":"/docs/dev-4","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"**公开文档都在这个文档站**：结构、ABI、插件写法、使用方式。"},"158":{"id":"/docs/dev-5","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么    | 在哪     |\n| ------ | ------ |\n| 结构与数据流 | 架构与数据流 |","table":"table-0"},"159":{"id":"/docs/dev-6","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么      | 在哪   |\n| -------- | ---- |\n| 构建、测试、发布 | 下面三页 |","table":"table-0"},"160":{"id":"/docs/dev-7","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么                       | 在哪                                    |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 当前状态 / 构建契约 / 已知缺口 / 踩过的坑 | 仓库里随源码分发的工程台账（`docs/`，不入库，只给改代码的人接力用） |","table":"table-0"},"161":{"id":"/docs/dev-8","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"仓库有一条硬规矩：**文档里出现的命令必须真跑过**，带输出的示例要抄真实输出。\n改行为就同步改文档：文档站给使用者与插件作者，仓库里的工程台账给下一个改代码的人。\n否则下一个人会比你更相信旧文档。"},"162":{"id":"/docs/dev-9","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"架构与数据流\" href=\"/docs/dev/architecture/\" />"},"163":{"id":"/docs/dev-10","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"构建与测试\" href=\"/docs/dev/build-test/\" />"},"164":{"id":"/docs/dev-11","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"常见陷阱\" href=\"/docs/dev/pitfalls/\" />"},"165":{"id":"/docs/dev-12","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"发布\" href=\"/docs/dev/release/\" />"},"166":{"id":"/docs/dev-13","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#一分钟上手","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**：`TDLIB_TD_API_TL` → 缓存 → 从 Releases 下载，拿不到就让构建失败。\n仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已经把缓存指到 `.tdlib-cache/`（相对仓库根），所以上面三条直接敲就行。"},"167":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"page","content":"常见陷阱","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls"},"168":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","content":"编号即引用锚：这些坑真踩过，别再踩回去"},"169":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"ABI 与回调"},"170":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"事件语义"},"171":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"TDLib"},"172":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"Rust / Windows"},"173":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","content":"每条都**真踩过**。这里挑最容易复发的几类；仓库内部的台账编号是跨文件引用锚，只随源码分发，不在这里展开。"},"174":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**`extern \"C\"` 边界逃出去的 panic 直接 abort**，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind`：插件与中间件回调必须是\n`unsafe extern \"C-unwind\"`，`define_plugin!` 自己也要包一层。"},"175":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**一个 crate 只能展开一次 `define_plugin!`**：四个导出符号名是 ABI 定死的，展开两次必然重复定义。"},"176":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**订阅句柄必须活着**：每轮循环里 `let _h = …` 就是每轮退订；`for` 里注册要把句柄收进循环外的 `Vec`。"},"177":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**`Effect` / `Subscription` 是 `#[must_use]`**：`let _ =` 会立刻回滚；`drop` 就是注销。"},"178":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"**归属（scope）不是「排除广播」**：第一版写成「全局 `emit` 只发 scope 0」，插件永远收不到更新。\n正确语义是「`emit` 发给所有人；`emit_scoped(scope)` 额外定向给该归属」。"},"179":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"**过滤器里的 `event_type` 键只选通道**，不参与负载匹配。"},"180":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**方法名/字段路径按 TDLib 来，不按 Bot API**：只有 `sendMessage` + `input_message_content`；\n`updateFile` 的 file id 在 `file.id` 不是顶层 `file_id`；`user` 没有 `is_bot` / `username`。"},"181":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**`td_api.tl` 的「函数 vs 构造器」只认 `---functions---` / `---types---` 标记**：\n`updateNewMessage … = Update` 是构造器，任何按首字母大写的启发式都会误判。"},"182":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**写死 TDLib 方法名/参数名的模块必须留一条 `check_request` 测试**（离线就能红）。"},"183":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**`Context` 的固有方法会遮蔽扩展 trait 的同名方法**：命名服务只能叫 `provide_named` / `resolve`。"},"184":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**thiserror 把名为 `source` 的字段当错误链**：存额外文本的字段叫 `detail`。"},"185":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**Windows 文件锁是强制锁**：锁住的字节范围别人 `read` 会 `ERROR_LOCK_VIOLATION`，\n所以实例状态把「锁」与「内容」分成两个文件（`.fuyubot/lock` 与 `.fuyubot/status`）。"},"186":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**PowerShell 的 `Get-Content` 在本机按 cp936 解码 UTF-8**：中文注释会毁，还会吞换行导致行号错位。\n改源码一律用编辑器工具，shell 只用来跑命令。"},"187":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**`tar` 在 Windows runner 上要 POSIX 路径**（`/d/a/…`）：GNU tar 会把 `D:/…` 当成「连主机 D」。"},"188":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"> 新踩的坑要补进仓库的 `docs/pitfalls.md` 台账（随源码分发）并给新编号——编号是跨文件引用锚。"},"189":{"id":"/docs/dev/release","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"page","content":"发布","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release"},"190":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"两套发布资产（TDLib 库 / fuyubot 本体）与文档站的静态部署"},"191":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"TDLib 资产（构建期契约）"},"192":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"fuyubot 本体（用户下载即用）"},"193":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"文档站"},"194":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"仓库有两套**互不替代**的发布资产，tag 前缀不同，别混："},"195":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"| 资产                            | tag           | 生产方                                        | 谁消费                             |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| TDLib 动态库 `TDLib-<os>-<arch>` | `TDLib-v<版本>` | `build-tdlib.yml` + `.github/scripts/*.sh` | 构建期（`fuyubot-tdlib` 的 loader 表） |","table":"table-0"},"196":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"| 资产                                      | tag     | 生产方               | 谁消费         |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------- | ----------------- | ----------- |\n| fuyubot 本体 `fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip` | `v<版本>` | `release-bot.yml` | 终端用户下载、解压即跑 |","table":"table-0"},"197":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"消费方是 `crates/fuyubot-tdlib/src/loader/vendored.rs` 的 `ASSETS` 表，生产方是\n`.github/workflows/build-tdlib.yml` 的 matrix；`tests/release_assets.rs` 会**读 workflow 双向比对**，\n漂了就红。四条硬要求："},"198":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"tag 必须精确是 **`TDLib-v<版本>`**（下载 URL 由 `release_url()` 拼）；"},"199":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"资产名**精确等于** `ASSETS` 表的值，**不带扩展名**，`<os>-<arch>` 用 cargo 口径（`x86_64` / `aarch64`）；"},"200":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"内容必须是 **`.tar.gz`**（`.zip` 会被 `extract_library` 当裸库原样写出，得到坏文件还不报错）；"},"201":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"**加平台只动 `ASSETS` 表 + CI matrix，两边同时加**（`macos/x86_64` 故意不在表里：没有那个 runner）。"},"202":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"运行时仓库的 `release-bot.yml` 在 `v*` tag（或手动 dispatch）上按平台编 `fuyubot-cli` 与三个内置插件，\n**构建阶段就把最终布局组好**（`plugins/` 直接填内置插件，不单独打包），每平台出一份中间\n`.tar.gz`（已是最终布局）；`publish`（Linux runner）把它转成用户下载的 zip 再挂 Release："},"203":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"**资产名**：`fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`，例 `fuyubot-v0.1.0-windows-x86_64.zip`。\n`<版本>` 取自 tag（分支上手动构建退回 `dev-<sha7>`）；`<OS>` = windows / linux / macos，\n`<平台>` = x86_64 / aarch64。名字里带版本，同一页 Release 里多个构建可以并存、一眼可辨。"},"204":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"**zip 解压出来就是本体**——不再套一层目录："},"205":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"`fuyubot-sdk-<os>-<arch>.zip` 由 **SDK 仓库**（`FuyuBot-SDK` 的 `release-sdk.yml`）发布，\n不混进运行时的包。"},"206":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"平台集合与 `ASSETS` 表一致：Windows / Linux 各 x86_64 + aarch64，**macOS 只有 aarch64**。"},"207":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"中间产物（每平台一份 `fuyubot-*.tar.gz`）只留在 Actions artifacts 里，**不挂 Release**——\n它是构建产物，不是发布形态。"},"208":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"三条契约：**资产名 `fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`**、**zip 解压即本体**（无套层目录）、\n**`tdjson` 与可执行文件同级**（靠 loader 优先级 2「可执行文件所在目录」命中）。\nzip 只在 `publish`（Linux runner）里生成，Windows runner 的 bash 没有 `zip` 命令。"},"209":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"GitHub Actions 在本机验不了。改 workflow 的组包步骤时，把 `Package the runtime` 与\n`Turn each bundle into a flat zip` 两段 bash **原样抠出来在本机跑一次**，\n解压产物验证 `--version` / `init` / `run --replay` / `--no-login --background` 全通——\n这一步是踩过「改了却没验」之后定的规矩。"},"210":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"本站是静态导出（`output: 'export'`），产物 `out/`："},"211":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"**push `main` 自动构建并发布到 `gh-pages`**（`pages.yml`；Pages 的 source 是 `gh-pages` 分支）。\nGitHub Pages 是项目页（挂在 `/FuyuBot-docs/` 下）：构建前设 `NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH=/FuyuBot-docs`，\n正式域名在**构建前**设 `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`（绝对 URL 是烘进产物的）；\n`public/.nojekyll` 不能少（`_next/` 以 `_` 开头会被 Jekyll 吞掉）。"},"212":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"发布前过一遍提交检查清单：文档站与运行时仓库里的工程台账都更新、`cargo build/test/fmt` 三条绿、\n没把凭据写进任何文件。"},"213":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"page","content":"simplify 封装是怎么实现的","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals"},"214":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","content":"按功能范围拆开 fuyubot-simplify 的实现：等待语义、同步 td_execute、错误映射、异步线程与测试守卫"},"215":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"三条不可协商的原则"},"216":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"1. 请求出口：一切经 ABI"},"217":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"2. 文本链路：为什么不异步"},"218":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"3. 发送：两步合成一次等待"},"219":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"4. 编辑 / 删除 / 应答：只有一步"},"220":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"5. 富消息：为什么单列一条路"},"221":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"6. 等待层：三个底层出口"},"222":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么两层-box","content":"7. 命令订阅：为什么两层 Box"},"223":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"8. 异步版：一次调用一个线程"},"224":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"9. 错误映射"},"225":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"10. 真 schema 守卫（离线测试）"},"226":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#11-后加的四个子系统各自为什么这么实现","content":"11. 后加的四个子系统：各自为什么这么实现"},"227":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"管理权：为什么返回 `bool`"},"228":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#转发为什么不等发送结局","content":"转发：为什么不等发送结局"},"229":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"表情反应：bot 与用户号是两套方法"},"230":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"连接状态：只能订阅"},"231":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"话题：`MessageTopic` 有四个构造器"},"232":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"12. 加一个新方法 / 新字段的清单"},"233":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","content":"这一篇是给**改这一层的人**看的：为什么这么做，以及加东西时该动哪儿。\n用这一层的人请先看插件 › Simplify 封装。"},"234":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"**只简化输入，不改变输出。** 返回值永远是 TDLib 的原始 JSON（`Value` / `Vec<Value>`），\n不带自己的包装类型。插件要能随时退回手写请求。"},"235":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"**一个方法一个参数结构体 + 短字段名。** `text` / `media` / `topic_id` 这些名字只服务于「人好写」，\n到 TDLib 字段名的映射**只有一处实现**（`send_params` / `edit_*_params` / `put_common`）。\n短名字不代表裸标量：`topic_id` 是 `Topic`，\n`media` 是 `Media`——凡是有「选哪个构造器」问题的一律用枚举，不用 `i64` 让人猜。"},"236":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"**公开方法都等到结果**（唯一例外是同步的 `formatted`）。请求号不外泄——泄漏就意味着调用方要自己管\n`old_message_id` / `request_id` 那一套，而这正是这一层要替人扛的东西。"},"237":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-23","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"改这一层之前先读一遍这三条：违反任何一条的改动，都应该先回来改这一节说清楚为什么要破例。"},"238":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-24","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"`Simplify` 只持有一个 `HostApi`（它是 `Copy`）。**没有一处**直接碰 `tdjson` 的符号："},"239":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-25","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"异步方法走 `host.td_invoke_simplified(\"方法名\", payload)`——`@type` 由宿主补，\n返回 `RequestId`；响应从 `\"response\"` 通道回来（只发给发起请求的那个插件）。"},"240":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-26","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"唯一走别的是 `formatted`：同步的 `host.td_execute`（下一节解释）。"},"241":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-27","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"参数 JSON 不是字符串拼接，而是 `serde_json::Map` 一层层 `insert` 出来的——每个字段「发 / 不发」\n在代码里一眼能看出来（`Option` 为 `None` 就是整个字段缺省，不是发 `null`）。"},"242":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-28","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"`Text { text, parse_mode }` → `formattedText { text, entities }` 只有一条路：TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities`。\n**这里刻意不做第二套解析器**——一旦自己解析，「我们认的语法」和「Telegram 认的语法」就开始漂移\n（实测就已经够意外了：MarkdownV2 的粗体是 `*x*`，`**x**` 会被吞成 `x` 且不给 bold entity）。"},"243":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-29","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"代价是一次往返，而这次往返**必须是同步的**："},"244":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-30","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"插件通常正是在**更新回调里**发消息，而「更新」和「响应」都靠接收循环那个线程投递。\n在那儿 `td_invoke` + 等响应 = 自己卡自己的投递线程，等到的一定是超时。\n`parseTextEntities` 不碰服务器，TDLib 允许同步跑它（`td_json_client_execute`）——所以这条链路\n即使在**更新回调里**也是安全的，换成异步等待反而会把自己卡死。"},"245":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-31","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"实现上的三点："},"246":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-32","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"`ParseMode::to_td()` 把四个模式换成三个 `TextParseMode`（`Plain` 返回 `None`，直接跳过请求）；"},"247":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-33","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"拿不到结果（没接 TDLib / 报错 / 回了个别的）→ `formatted_from` 退回纯文本，并打一条 `Warn`；\n一条 Markdown 写错的消息不该让整条消息发不出去；"},"248":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-34","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"`formatted` 作为**渲染闭包**传进 `send_params(.., render)` / `edit_*_params(.., render)`，\n所以每个发送 / 编辑方法都自动得到「文本的最终形态」，不需要各自处理解析。"},"249":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-35","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"TDLib 是异步的，`sendMessage` 的真相是这样的："},"250":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-36","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"封装把 ②③ 合成一次（见 `await_response` / `await_outcome`）："},"251":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-37","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"`await_response`：等 `\"response\"` 通道，`request_id` 精确匹配；`@type == \"error\"` → `SimplifyError::Tdlib`；"},"252":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-38","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"`await_outcome`：走**兜底的 `\"update\"` 通道** + `\"old_message_id\"` 匹配。成功与失败两条更新都在这条通道上，\n所以一次等待就能拿到「到底成了没」；按临时消息的 id 精确对号，同一会话里别人的结局不会串进来。"},"253":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-39","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"**超时先补救**：`cancel_sending` 用 `deleteMessages(revoke = true)` 把那条还没发出去的消息撤掉，\n再返回 `Timeout(u64)`。发出去的撤不回，没发出去的会被取消。这一步**只打日志**，不把删除的成败返回结果。"},"254":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-40","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"相册是同一套的 N 倍：`sendMessageAlbum` 的响应是 `Messages`（一组），`pending_messages` 取出每一项的临时 id，\n然后**逐项** `await_outcome`。`timeout_ms` 是**整组共用一个预算**——方法是把 deadline 算出来，\n每次只剩 `remaining_ms(deadline)`，不是每项各重新计时。"},"255":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-41","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"`AlbumSize` 是**发之前**挡下来的（`invoke_send_album` 里先验 2–10 项），因为一个错项数的相册\n发出去也只会让服务端拒绝，不如在本地给个清脆的错误。"},"256":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-42","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"这类方法**没有结局更新**——结果就是响应本身："},"257":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-43","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"成功 ⇒ `Message`（编辑）或 `ok`（删除 / 应答）；"},"258":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-44","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"`@type == \"error\"` ⇒ `SimplifyError::Tdlib`（`Message is not modified`、消息太老删不动都在这一档）。"},"259":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-45","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"**这里刻意不重试**：该等多久是限流策略的事，调用方比封装层更清楚。"},"260":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-46","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"`editMessageReplyMarkup` 是真签名里 `reply_markup` **必填**的那个（`chat_id message_id reply_markup`），\n所以「不要键盘」不能靠省略字段表示，必须发 `replyMarkupRemoveKeyboard`——`edit_markup_params` 用\n`entry(..).or_insert_with(..)` 兜住这一点。相册要挂键盘就只能先发、再用这条改。"},"261":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-47","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"`messageRichMessage` 与普通消息的互斥规则完全不同（那边「文本 / 媒体」二选一，这边是一棵树），\n所以它有独立参数类型 `RichMessageParams` 与独立的构造入口（`RichMessage`）。"},"262":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-48","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"特殊性在于：**Markdown/HTML 源由服务端解析且仅 bot 可用**，让 local 之间也就没有中间态可看。\n为了让用户号也能写 Markdown，`fuyubot-simplify` 带了一份**受控子集**的本地转换器\n（`markdown` 模块 → `InputPageBlock` 块树）：认不出的一律退回普通文本，不报错。\n按钮在 Markdown 里没有语法，所以是显式的 `RichButton` + `with_button_row`。"},"263":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-49","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"实现细节、覆盖表与测试分工在插件 › 富消息，这里不重复——\n**只记住一条**：发/编辑也只是 `sendMessage` / `editMessageText` + `inputMessageRichMessage`，\n出口仍然只有一个。"},"264":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-50","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"公开方法底下其实只有三种等待："},"265":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-51","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"| 出口                              | 等什么     | 过滤器                                        |\n| ------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `wait_response(request_id, ms)` | 某个请求的响应 | `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":…}` |","table":"table-0"},"266":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-52","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"| 出口                            | 等什么     | 过滤器                       |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------- |\n| `wait_for_update(filter, ms)` | 一条匹配的更新 | `UpdateFilter::to_json()` |","table":"table-0"},"267":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-53","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"| 出口                    | 等什么                          | 过滤器                                   |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `download_file` 内部的循环 | 一组 `updateFile`，直到 completed | `{\"event_type\":\"update\",\"file.id\":…}` |","table":"table-0"},"268":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-54","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"`UpdateFilter::to_json()` 里有个容易写错的地方：`update_type` 落在 **`event_type` 键**（通道选择），\n其余条件才是对负载的字段匹配；普通更新把消息包在 `message` 里（所以条件是 `message.chat_id`），\n而 `updateNewCallbackQuery` 这类把字段放在顶层（`UpdateFilter::flat` 切的就是这个前缀）。"},"269":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-55","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"`wait_for_update` 返回的 `WaitHandle::payload_json` 是宿主的**线程局部缓冲**，只在下一次宿主调用前有效；\n`wait_for_update_json` 内部用 `payload_of` 当场拷成 `Value`。凡是跨越宿主调用的，都要拷。"},"270":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-56","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么两层-box","content":"`on_command` 把 Rust 闭包交给 C 回调，`user_data` 必须是一个**稳定**的指针："},"271":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-57","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么两层-box","content":"外层 Box 活着时，内层 Box 的地址不变；传给 ABI 的是**内层 Box 的胖指针目标地址**（瘦指针），\ntrampoline 里再还原成 `&Box<dyn Fn(..)>`。所有权整体压在 `CommandSubscription` 上，\n所以 **drop = 退订**（`Drop` 里调 `host.off(handle)`），语义跟 `Effect` 一致。"},"272":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-58","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么两层-box","content":"trampoline 是 `extern \"C-unwind\"`（宿主要求），并且对所有空指针先 `return -1` / `0`，不会 panic 过 FFI。"},"273":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-59","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"`*_then` 的实现就三行——`spawn_then(move || simplify.xxx(..), on_done)`："},"274":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-60","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"因为等待必须是阻塞的（上层 API 就是这么设计的），要「不阻塞」只能换线程。代价是每次调用一个 OS 线程\n（有 `timeout_ms` 兜着，不会一直挂着），并且 `JoinHandle` 必须交回插件——**插件卸载前要 join**，\n否则动态库卸载之后线程还在执行库里的代码。这是 Gotcha，不是建议。"},"275":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-61","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"这一层**不引入 async runtime**：阻塞 + 线程已经够表达这套语义，而且 `HostApi` 本身是同步的 C ABI。"},"276":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-62","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源               | 变体                                   |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 请求本身就发不出去（ABI 层） | `Abi(AbiError)`（宿主没接 TDLib 时也会在这里冒泡） |","table":"table-1"},"277":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-63","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源        | 变体          |\n| --------- | ----------- |\n| 参数串里含 NUL | `BadString` |","table":"table-1"},"278":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-64","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源                     | 变体                        |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 响应是 `@type == \"error\"` | `Tdlib { code, message }` |","table":"table-1"},"279":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-65","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源                        | 变体                             |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `updateMessageSendFailed` | `SendFailed { code, message }` |","table":"table-1"},"280":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-66","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源               | 变体             |\n| ---------------- | -------------- |\n| 到期没结局（**已先撤回**过） | `Timeout(u64)` |","table":"table-1"},"281":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-67","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源                                    | 变体                                                                                                              |\n| ------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 本地校验挡下来的（相册项数、空的富消息 / 按钮行、源不是块树、转发条数） | `AlbumSize` / `EmptyRichMessage` / `RichSourceNotBlocks` / `EmptyButtonRow` / `EmptyForward` / `TooManyForward` |","table":"table-1"},"282":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-68","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"身份类查询（`me` / `chat_member`）走的是另一条路：**不把错误往上传**。\n调用方只想要「有 / 没有管理权」，不该被迫处理 TDLib 的错误码，所以内部 `soften`\n把 `error` 响应记一行 `Warn` 之后当成「没拿到」，再由上层的 `bool` 方法折成 `false`。"},"283":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-69","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"区分 `Tdlib` 与 `SendFailed` 是有意的：**方法被拒绝**和**发出去了但没发成**是两回事，\n调用方的处理也不一样（前者通常是用法错，后者通常是限流 / 权限）。"},"284":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-70","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"靠肉眼对 `td_api.tl` 是靠不住的（本文开头那批方法名以前就按 Bot API 拼错过一次），\n所以每次改动都要过这几条离线测试："},"285":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-71","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`every_request_simplify_builds_passes_the_real_schema`：`TdApiSchema::compiled()`\n（编译期从 `td_api.tl` 烤出来的元数据）逐条 `check_request(\"方法名\", &payload)`——\n参数名写错、漏字段、多发字段都会失败，**不需要联网**；"},"286":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-72","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`every_media_kind_becomes_one_send_message` / `media_setters_touch_only_the_variants_that_have_the_field`：\n七个 `Media` 变体各自的 `inputMessage*` 形状，以及「链式设置器只在有这个字段的变体上生效」；"},"287":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-73","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`album_rejects_wrong_sizes` / `edit_reply_markup_is_how_an_album_gets_a_keyboard`：\n上面两节说的那些边界；"},"288":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-74","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`block_syntax_covers_the_official_table` / `input_page_block_coverage_is_accounted_for`\n（在 `rich.rs`）：本地 Markdown 转换器对着官方 Rich Markdown 表一类一例，加块 / 删块会让它失败。"},"289":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-75","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"上面第一条只覆盖「离线也发得出去」的那些请求。**要走账号分支的**（比如 bot 专用的\n`setMessageReactions`）离线根本走不到，所以 `chat.rs` 里另有一条\n`new_request_shapes_pass_the_real_schema`：直接把 `*_params` 函数拼出来的形状喂给\n`check_request`。加新方法时**两边都要接**：前者靠在 schema 测试里补一次调用，后者靠补一个 case。"},"290":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-76","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"嵌套构造器的名字同样要验：`every_message_topic_constructor_is_reachable` 检查四个\n`MessageTopic` 构造器的 `@type` 与字段名都还在真 `td_api.tl` 里（见下一节）。"},"291":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-77","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"在线行为（`cargo test -p fuyubot-tdlib -- --ignored`）验证的是「真库认不认这些值」，与上面这层互补。"},"292":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-78","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"TDLib 里没有「这个人是不是管理员」这种字段：`user` 连 `is_bot` 都没有（身份在 `user.type`），\n管理权只在 `getChatMember` 的 `ChatMember.status` 里。所以："},"293":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-79","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"`chat_member()` 拿原始 `ChatMember`（想要细节就用它）；"},"294":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-80","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"`is_chat_admin` / `am_i_chat_admin` 直接返回 `bool`——**不是 `Result<bool>`**。\n查不到的四种情况（超时 / TDLib 报错 / 不是群聊 / 拿不到自己 id）答案都一样：\n「不确定」时说「没有」比说「有」安全，让调用方处理一堆「其实是没查到」的 `Err` 没有价值。"},"295":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-81","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"「自己」没有捷径：`getChat` 不带「我是不是管理员」，只能 `getMe` 拿 id 再 `getChatMember`。\n两次等待**各用一份** `timeout_ms`。"},"296":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-82","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"群主（`chatMemberStatusCreator`）**没有** `rights` 结构，所以除了 `is_anonymous`（它在 creator\n自己的字段上）以外一律算「有」——`is_admin_status` 里这个分支是显式的。"},"297":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-83","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#转发为什么不等发送结局","content":"`forwardMessages` 的响应是 `Messages`，和 `sendMessage` 一样是**还没发完**的临时消息。\n这里刻意只等响应：转发的成败通常不参与后续逻辑，多等一轮（N 条 `updateMessageSend*`）不划算。\nTDLib 单项失败时在对应位置放 `null`，所以调用方仍能按位判断。"},"298":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-84","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#转发为什么不等发送结局","content":"`message_ids` 在 `forward_params` 里**排序去重**：TDLib 要求严格递增，而调用方手里的 id 多半\n是从若干条更新里攒出来的。"},"299":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-85","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"|     | 用户号                  | bot                                  |\n| --- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 加一个 | `addMessageReaction` | `setMessageReactions`（**bot 只能用这个**） |","table":"table-2"},"300":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-86","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"|     | 用户号                     | bot                        |\n| --- | ----------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| 去掉  | `removeMessageReaction` | `setMessageReactions` 传空列表 |","table":"table-2"},"301":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-87","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"语义差别是真实的：用户是「在已有反应上追加 / 删掉指定的一个」，bot 是「整组覆盖」。\n所以 bot 侧的 `unreact` **忽略** `reaction` 参数直接清空——这一点写在方法文档里，不要当 bug 修。"},"302":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-88","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"判定靠 `getMe` 的 `user.type`，也就是每次 `react` 多一次往返。**这里刻意不做缓存**：\n`Simplify` 是 `Copy` 且无状态，加个进程级 `OnceLock` 会让「离线环境拿到过什么」变成隐藏状态，\n测试也会被污染。调用方已经知道自己是哪种时，直接调 `add_reaction` / `set_reactions` 就绕开了。"},"303":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-89","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"TDLib 没有 `getConnectionState`，状态只以 `updateConnectionState` 出现且**不重放**——\n所以只能订阅并记住最新那条，`ConnectionTracker` 就是干这个的："},"304":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-90","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"与第 7 节的「两层 Box」同一个道理：结构体会**按值返回**（被移动），\n只有堆上那一份的地址能交出去给 ABI。所有权压在 `ConnectionTracker` 上，所以 **drop = 退订**。"},"305":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-91","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"`is_ready()` 对「还没收到过任何更新」也返回 `false`——宁可保守，别把「不知道」当「连上了」。\n⚠️ 这是**连接**状态，不是授权状态：`connectionStateReady` 也可能还没登录。"},"306":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-92","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`sendMessage` / `sendMessageAlbum` / `forwardMessages` 的 `topic_id` 是 `MessageTopic`，\n**不是**一个裸 id："},"307":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-93","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`messageTopicForum { forum_topic_id: int32 }` —— **论坛**群组，以及与 bot 的私聊；"},"308":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-94","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`messageTopicThread { message_thread_id: int53 }` —— **非论坛**群组的评论串；"},"309":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-95","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`messageTopicDirectMessages` / `messageTopicSavedMessages`。"},"310":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-96","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"这一层以前固定按 `messageTopicThread` 拼，等于在非论坛群以外全错，所以改成 `Topic` 枚举并\n**不给 `From<i64>`**：论坛话题是 `int32`、评论串是 `int53`，一个裸数字说不清是哪一种。"},"311":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-97","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**参数结构体**（一个方法一个，字段用短名字）→ `Default`（`timeout_ms` 用 `DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_MS`）；"},"312":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-98","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**请求组装函数** `xxx_params(.., render)`：`@type` 不要自己写（那是宿主补的），\n字段名以真 `td_api.tl` 为准；"},"313":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-99","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**`Simplify` 上的方法**：阻塞版等到结果 + 同名 `*_then`（见第 8 节）；"},"314":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-100","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**补测试**：先让 `every_request_simplify_builds_passes_the_real_schema` 盖住新请求；"},"315":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-101","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**补文档**：插件 › Simplify 封装 里按**功能范围**归到对应那一节，\n别新开章节堆在末尾。"},"316":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-102","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"方法名 / 字段名**不要按 Telegram Bot API 的直觉写**。TDLib 里一切发送都是 `sendMessage`，\n媒体类型在 `input_message_content.@type` 里；话题是 `topic_id`（而且是 `MessageTopic`，\n论坛话题是 `messageTopicForum` **不是** `messageTopicThread`）、回复是 `reply_to`、\n没有顶层 `caption`。要查就查真 `td_api.tl`（或 `fuyubot-sdk td-method <名字>`）。"},"317":{"id":"/docs","page_id":"/docs","type":"page","content":"fuyubot 文档","tags":[],"url":"/docs"},"318":{"id":"/docs-0","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"基于 TDLib 的 Telegram bot / user 框架"},"319":{"id":"/docs-1","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"两个 CLI，职责严格分离"},"320":{"id":"/docs-2","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"现在能验证到什么程度"},"321":{"id":"/docs-3","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#下一步","content":"下一步"},"322":{"id":"/docs-4","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"**fuyubot** 是一个基于 TDLib 的 Telegram bot / user 框架：Rust 内核 + C ABI 插件 + 多语言 SDK。\n插件就是一个动态库（`.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`），一个 cdylib 就是一个插件。"},"323":{"id":"/docs-5","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"使用文档\" href=\"/docs/usage/\" description=\"下载安装、配置文件、运行、回放、实例管理与排错\" />"},"324":{"id":"/docs-6","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"插件开发\" href=\"/docs/plugin/\" description=\"Rust / C / C++ / Python / JS / TS 插件、事件、TDLib 调用与 ABI\" />"},"325":{"id":"/docs-7","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"开发文档\" href=\"/docs/dev/\" description=\"改框架本身：架构、构建测试、常见陷阱、发布\" />"},"326":{"id":"/docs-8","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"CLI 文档\" href=\"/docs/cli/\" description=\"fuyubot 与 fuyubot-sdk 的完整命令参考\" />"},"327":{"id":"/docs-9","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"| CLI       | 干什么 | 子命令                                           |\n| --------- | --- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot` | 跑框架 | `init` / `run` / `status` / `stop` / `plugin` |","table":"table-0"},"328":{"id":"/docs-10","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"| CLI           | 干什么 | 子命令                                                                       |\n| ------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-sdk` | 写插件 | `init` / `codegen` / `check` / `abi-version` / `td-methods` / `td-method` |","table":"table-0"},"329":{"id":"/docs-11","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"两个都**不编译、不打包插件**——编译是插件作者用自己语言工具链（`cargo build`、`cl /LD`、`gcc -shared`）完成的事，\n`fuyubot plugin install` 只负责把编好的产物**复制**进插件目录。"},"330":{"id":"/docs-12","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"离线回放（`--replay`）与实例三件套（单实例锁 / 后台运行 / `status` / `stop`）是端到端跑过的。\n真实账号登录 `run` 会接上 TDLib 走授权状态机，但**没有拿真账号端到端验过**「收真更新 → 插件回一条」。"},"331":{"id":"/docs-13","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"内核、插件 ABI、加载器、更新管线、四大机制：有测试，全绿"},"332":{"id":"/docs-14","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"真 TDLib（真 `tdjson` + 真 `td_api.tl`）：`getMe` 往返、同步 `execute`、插件调 TDLib 收响应，都在 `-- --ignored` 自检里验过"},"333":{"id":"/docs-15","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"`td_api.tl` 在**编译期**被转成元数据烤进二进制，运行时不读文件、不解析"},"334":{"id":"/docs-16","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#现在能验证到什么程度","content":"`tdjson` **运行时动态加载**，构建期会把它拷到可执行文件同级目录"},"335":{"id":"/docs-17","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"**普通用户**：到 Releases 下对应平台的包，解压就跑 ——\n见 下载与安装"},"336":{"id":"/docs-18","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"要自己编：见 从源码构建"},"337":{"id":"/docs-19","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"要写插件：看 插件总览"},"338":{"id":"/docs-20","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"想改框架：看 开发文档"},"339":{"id":"/docs-21","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"卡住了：看 常见问题"},"340":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"page","content":"ABI 契约","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi"},"341":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi","content":"HostApiVTable、导出符号、内存所有权与版本协商"},"342":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"插件必须导出的符号"},"343":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"HostApiVTable：`host_ctx` + 19 个函数指针"},"344":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"内存所有权：三条硬规矩"},"345":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"版本协商"},"346":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"为什么本 ABI 一个可变参数函数指针都没有"},"347":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"五种语言各自声明的兼容 ABI 版本"},"348":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"回调为什么是 `C-unwind`"},"349":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi","content":"这是**唯一**的跨语言契约：形状只有 `fuyubot-abi/src/lib.rs` 一份实现，C 头文件\n`fuyubot_plugin.h` 由 cbindgen 从它生成（**产物，不是源码**，别手改）。宿主侧所有桥在\n`fuyubot-loader/src/runtime.rs`。**改 ABI = 改那个文件 + 加版本号。**"},"350":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"v3 的四个契约符号仍是必需/可选的底线；v4 另外导出三个**静态符号**，让\n`fuyubot-sdk check` 不 dlopen 也能看见插件是按哪个 ABI 编的（版本值仍只能运行时判定）。"},"351":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号            | 类型                                                           | 必须吗    | 说明                                              |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_init` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(*const HostApiVTable) -> PluginHandle` | **必须** | 校验 VTable、构造状态；返回失败句柄（`abi_version == 0`）= 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-0"},"352":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号             | 类型                                                         | 必须吗 | 说明                                  |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | --- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(PluginHandle, *const c_char) -> i32` | 可选  | 拿到配置 JSON，注册订阅 / 工具 / 中间件；返回 `0` 成功 |","table":"table-0"},"353":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号            | 类型                                   | 必须吗 | 说明             |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------ | --- | -------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(PluginHandle)` | 可选  | 卸载前调一次，回收自己的状态 |","table":"table-0"},"354":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                   | 类型                                  | 必须吗    | 说明                                |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(*mut c_char)` | **必须** | 释放**插件自己**分配的字符串（宿主从不 free 插件的指针） |","table":"table-0"},"355":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                   | 类型                                   | 必须吗   | 说明                                                 |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ----- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(PluginHandle)` | v4 可选 | 版本不匹配、不能调 `plugin_stop` 时，用来释放 `plugin_init` 分配的状态 |","table":"table-0"},"356":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                    | 类型                              | 必须吗   | 说明                                     |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn() -> u32` | v4 可选 | 返回编译期 `ABI_VERSION`；静态工具只检查“存在”，值要运行时看 |","table":"table-0"},"357":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                | 类型                                        | 必须吗   | 说明                                                |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn() -> *const c_char` | v4 可选 | 自描述 JSON（名字 + `inject` / `soft_inject`）；宿主接线仍在进行中 |","table":"table-0"},"358":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"符号名由常量钉住（`SYM_PLUGIN_INIT` / `SYM_PLUGIN_START` / `SYM_PLUGIN_STOP` /\n`SYM_PLUGIN_FREE_STRING` / `SYM_PLUGIN_FREE_HANDLE` / `SYM_PLUGIN_ABI_VERSION` /\n`SYM_PLUGIN_MANIFEST`），`PluginLoader::load_with_config` 按这些名字 `lib.get(...)`。\nC++ 里必须把它们放进 `extern \"C\"` 块，否则名字被 mangle，宿主 dlsym 不到。"},"359":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"`PluginHandle` = `{ abi_version: u32, size: u32, context: *mut c_void, name: *const c_char }`；\n`is_valid()` 的判据是「`abi_version != 0` **且** `context` 非空」，所以插件的 `context` 不能是\n`NULL`。`PluginHandle::FAILED` 是全零版本号，`const _` 里有\n`assert!(PluginHandle::FAILED.abi_version == 0)`。"},"360":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"`version` 在偏移 0、`size` 在 4、`host_ctx` 在 8，其余 **19 个是函数指针**，全是 `Option<...>`；\n总大小 = `2 * size_of::<u32>() + 20 * size_of::<*const c_void>()`（`host_ctx` + 19 个函数），\n由 `const _` 里的 `offset_of!` / `size_of` 断言钉死。每个函数第一个参数都是 `host: *mut c_void`。"},"361":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"下表签名省略第一个参数 `host`："},"362":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段        | 签名    | 宿主实现          | 说明                                        |\n| --- | --------- | ----- | ------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| —   | `version` | `u32` | `ABI_VERSION` | 必须等于 `ABI_VERSION`；首个字段，插件能在读其它任何字段之前先比一次 |","table":"table-1"},"363":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段     | 签名    | 宿主实现                         | 说明                                  |\n| --- | ------ | ----- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| —   | `size` | `u32` | `size_of::<HostApiVTable>()` | 老宿主 + 新插件时先比 `size` 再读尾部字段，读越界就是 UB |","table":"table-1"},"364":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段         | 签名            | 宿主实现           | 说明                                 |\n| --- | ---------- | ------------- | -------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| —   | `host_ctx` | `*mut c_void` | `&HostRuntime` | 每个函数都原样回传；插件作者看不见它（`HostApi` 自动带上） |","table":"table-1"},"365":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段   | 签名                                                                      | 宿主实现     | 说明                                                                         |\n| --- | ---- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | `on` | `(update_type, filter_json, callback, user_data) -> SubscriptionHandle` | `api_on` | 订阅；`filter_json` 里的 `event_type` 选通道，其余键做负载匹配；`NULL` / 空串 / `\"null\"` = 收全部 |","table":"table-1"},"366":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段    | 签名               | 宿主实现      | 说明                   |\n| --- | ----- | ---------------- | --------- | -------------------- |\n| 2   | `off` | `(handle) -> ()` | `api_off` | 退订；句柄 drop 时宿主也会整批回滚 |","table":"table-1"},"367":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段     | 签名                                  | 宿主实现       | 说明                                              |\n| --- | ------ | ----------------------------------- | ---------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | `emit` | `(event_type, payload_json) -> i32` | `api_emit` | 发自定义事件；对插件而言是 `emit_scoped(自己, …)`，只送自己 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-1"},"368":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段              | 签名                                                    | 宿主实现                | 说明                                                                                                    |\n| --- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | `register_tool` | `(descriptor_json, handler, user_data) -> ToolHandle` | `api_register_tool` | 登记元数据 + 可选处理器；处理器是 `C-unwind fn(user_data, input_json) -> *const c_char`，只登记元数据用 `register_tool_meta` |","table":"table-1"},"369":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段          | 签名                                | 宿主实现            | 说明                                          |\n| --- | ----------- | --------------------------------- | --------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 5   | `call_tool` | `(name, input_json) -> RequestId` | `api_call_tool` | 走 `ToolRegistry::call_tool` 的请求号路径（兼容/异步工具） |","table":"table-1"},"370":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                 | 签名                                    | 宿主实现                   | 说明                                                   |\n| --- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 6   | `call_tool_result` | `(name, input_json) -> *const c_char` | `api_call_tool_result` | **同步**执行工具并返回结果 JSON（失败 `{\"error\":…}`）。宿主线程局部缓冲，读完即弃 |","table":"table-1"},"371":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                    | 宿主实现             | 说明                                 |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------- | ---------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 7   | `list_tools` | `() -> *const c_char` | `api_list_tools` | 全部工具的元数据 JSON 数组。**宿主线程局部缓冲**，读完即弃 |","table":"table-1"},"372":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段             | 签名                    | 宿主实现               | 说明                                    |\n| --- | -------------- | --------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------- |\n| 8   | `list_plugins` | `() -> *const c_char` | `api_list_plugins` | 进程内插件报告 JSON 数组（名字 / 状态 / 缺依赖 / 失败原因） |","table":"table-1"},"373":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                | 签名                                              | 宿主实现                  | 说明                       |\n| --- | ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| 9   | `provide_service` | `(name, *const ServiceVTable) -> ServiceHandle` | `api_provide_service` | 注册命名服务；`vtable` 必须活到注销为止 |","table":"table-1"},"374":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段            | 签名                               | 宿主实现              | 说明                  |\n| --- | ------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------- |\n| 10  | `get_service` | `(name) -> *const ServiceVTable` | `api_get_service` | 取回同一个指针；没有就是 `NULL` |","table":"table-1"},"375":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段          | 签名                           | 宿主实现            | 说明                           |\n| --- | ----------- | ---------------------------- | --------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| 11  | `td_invoke` | `(method_json) -> RequestId` | `api_td_invoke` | 发完整 TDLib 请求 JSON（含 `@type`） |","table":"table-1"},"376":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                     | 签名                                        | 宿主实现                       | 说明                                                      |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 12  | `td_invoke_simplified` | `(method_name, params_json) -> RequestId` | `api_td_invoke_simplified` | 给参数补上 `@type = method_name`；参数不是对象就整份替换成 `{\"@type\": …}` |","table":"table-1"},"377":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                                | 宿主实现             | 说明                                                                                                              |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------------------- | ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 13  | `td_execute` | `(request_json) -> *const c_char` | `api_td_execute` | **同步**执行不碰网络的方法（`td_json_client_execute`），当场返回响应 JSON。**不发请求号、不进请求留档、不等响应通道**——所以能在事件回调里用；宿主没接 TDLib 时返回 `NULL` |","table":"table-1"},"378":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段               | 签名                                                      | 宿主实现                 | 说明                     |\n| --- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 14  | `use_middleware` | `(stage: u32, callback, user_data) -> MiddlewareHandle` | `api_use_middleware` | 挂在某个阶段；回调返回非 0 → 本阶段中断 |","table":"table-1"},"379":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                | 签名                                             | 宿主实现                  | 说明                                                                           |\n| --- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 15  | `wait_for_update` | `(filter_json, timeout_ms: u64) -> WaitHandle` | `api_wait_for_update` | **阻塞**当前线程；`timeout_ms == 0` 表示只检查当前状态。Rust 插件优先用 `ResponseRouter` 的 await 版 |","table":"table-1"},"380":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段            | 签名               | 宿主实现              | 说明         |\n| --- | ------------- | ---------------- | ----------------- | ---------- |\n| 16  | `cancel_wait` | `(handle) -> ()` | `api_cancel_wait` | 从另一个线程取消等待 |","table":"table-1"},"381":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段    | 签名                            | 宿主实现      | 说明                                                              |\n| --- | ----- | ----------------------------- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 17  | `log` | `(level: u32, message) -> ()` | `api_log` | 落进宿主环形缓冲（`LOG_CAPACITY = 256`）并打一行到 stderr；非法 level 按 `Info` 处理 |","table":"table-1"},"382":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                                | 宿主实现             | 说明                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------------------- | ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 18  | `get_config` | `(section, key) -> *const c_char` | `api_get_config` | 读全局配置：`section` 空串读顶层（`[bot]` / `[telegram]` 等），否则把 `section` 当点路径在 `plugin` 表里下钻（`fuyubot.manage` → `plugin.fuyubot.manage`）；`key` 空串读整段、否则按点路径取键。**宿主线程局部缓冲**，读完即弃；段 / 键不存在返回 `NULL` |","table":"table-1"},"383":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                         | 宿主实现             | 说明                                                                                                                                    |\n| --- | ------------ | -------------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 19  | `set_config` | `(key, value_json) -> i32` | `api_set_config` | 写配置：**只能写调用者自己名下的段**（没有 section 参数，宿主按调用者身份判定，插件无法伪造）。`key` 空串覆盖整段、否则按点路径设键。返回 0 = 成功（写内存 + 回写 `fuyubot.toml`）；非 0 = 越权 / 解析失败 / 写盘失败 |","table":"table-1"},"384":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"两条形状上的硬要求："},"385":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"**第一个参数总是 `host: *mut c_void`**：裸函数指针没有捕获环境，VTable 里放不了闭包；\n不给显式上下文就只能靠进程级全局，那样一个进程只能有一个宿主、测试也没法并行。"},"386":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"**每个函数指针字段都是 `Option<...>`**：C 侧传 `NULL` 合法，非 `Option` 字段收到 `NULL` 就是 UB。\nRust 侧 `HostApi::from_raw` 一次解包校验全部 19 个，之后调用路径上没有 `Option`、也没有 panic 分支。"},"387":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--19-个函数指针","content":"句柄类型（`SubscriptionHandle` / `ToolHandle` / `ServiceHandle` / `MiddlewareHandle` / `RequestId`）\n都是 `#[repr(C)]` + 单个 `u64`（断言钉住 `size_of == size_of::<u64>()`）；\n`LogLevel` = 1..5（`Error` / `Warn` / `Info` / `Debug` / `Trace`），`Stage` = 0..5；\n`WaitHandle` = `{ id: u64, matched: u32, _reserved: u32, payload_json: *const c_char }`。"},"388":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**谁分配谁释放**。插件通过 `plugin_init` 返回的 `name`、以及插件自己分配的任何字符串，\n都由插件持有；宿主**绝不** free 它们。插件要给宿主一个需要接管的临时字符串，只能走\n`plugin_free_string` 那套约定。"},"389":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**宿主返回的字符串是线程局部缓冲**。`list_tools`、`get_config`、`WaitHandle::payload_json`\n指向宿主的一块复用缓冲（`thread_local! HOST_STRING`），**只在下一次调用宿主函数之前有效**。\n要留着就当场拷走，并且**不要试图释放它**——VTable 里没有 host 侧的 free 函数，这是设计不是遗漏。"},"390":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**`ServiceMethodFn` 的返回值由提供方持有**，调用方读完即弃。"},"391":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                    | 谁比           | 不匹配的后果 |\n| --------------------- | ------------ | ------ |\n| `ABI_VERSION`（当前 `4`） | 编译期常量，两侧共同引用 | —      |","table":"table-2"},"392":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                       | 谁比                      | 不匹配的后果                      |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `HostApiVTable::version` | 插件侧 `HostApi::from_raw` | `AbiError::VersionMismatch` |","table":"table-2"},"393":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                    | 谁比  | 不匹配的后果                     |\n| --------------------- | --- | -------------------------- |\n| `HostApiVTable::size` | 同上  | `AbiError::VTableTooSmall` |","table":"table-2"},"394":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置             | 谁比  | 不匹配的后果                               |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 某个函数指针是 `NULL` | 同上  | `AbiError::MissingFunction(\"<字段名>\")` |","table":"table-2"},"395":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                          | 谁比                 | 不匹配的后果                 |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------- |\n| `PluginHandle::abi_version` | 宿主侧 `PluginLoader` | `AbiMismatch`：**拒绝加载** |","table":"table-2"},"396":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"版本不兼容时宿主**不能**调 `plugin_stop`——那是对一个不认识的 ABI 下手。v4 起插件可以\n导出 `plugin_free_handle`，让宿主在版本不匹配时释放 `plugin_init` 分配的状态；老插件没有\n这个符号，那部分内存仍然回收不了。字段只增不改，新增一律追加在尾部。"},"397":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 2 的改动**：尾部追加了 `td_execute`（同步执行，见上表第 13 项）。"},"398":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 3 的改动**：尾部追加了 `get_config` / `set_config`（第 18 / 19 项），让插件能读全局配置、\n写自己的段。"},"399":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 4 的改动**："},"400":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"`register_tool` 增加 `handler` / `user_data`，工具终于能真的执行；"},"401":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"尾部追加 `call_tool_result`（同步拿工具结果）与 `list_plugins`（插件报告）；"},"402":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"新增静态导出 `plugin_free_handle` / `fuyubot_abi_version` / `plugin_manifest`。"},"403":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"追加字段本身不破坏老插件（它们先比 `size`），但按契约「改 ABI 就加版本号」，\n`ABI_VERSION` 一起跳到 4——**用旧版本编出来的插件会被宿主拒绝加载**，重新编一次即可\n（仓库里所有插件与模板都从 `ABI_VERSION` 取值）。"},"404":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"Rust 的 `extern \"C\" fn(.., ...)` 确实稳定（能写、cbindgen 也能生成），但**本 ABI 一个都没用**，\n理由只有一条：`...` 会把**参数类型和个数校验全部丢掉**。VTable 里 19 个函数的参数都是固定的，\n用 `...` 只会让 C 侧传错参数从编译错误降级成运行期 UB。"},"405":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"将来真要加，正确的声明形状是（C 侧）："},"406":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"两条必须知道的事："},"407":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"变参部分**不能**是唯一的参数——C 要求 `...` 之前至少有一个具名参数。"},"408":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"**变参函数指针跨不了 ABI 的 `Option` 优化**：`Option<fn(..., ...)>` 不是 niche 优化，占**两个指针宽**，\n必须显式判空。本 crate 里那条\n`size_of::<Option<unsafe extern \"C\" fn()>>() == size_of::<*const c_void>()` 断言只对**非变参**函数指针\n成立；普通函数指针字段能享受 niche 优化（`NULL` 就是 `None`），这也是「整个 VTable 所有字段都能是\n`Option<...>` 且不撑大布局」的前提之一。"},"409":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言  | 声明在哪                                              | 值   | 怎么生效                                                                      |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| C   | 头文件 `fuyubot_plugin.h` 里的 `#define ABI_VERSION 4` | 4   | 模板里写 `if (host == NULL \\|\\| host->version != ABI_VERSION) return failed;` |","table":"table-3"},"410":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言  | 声明在哪                   | 值   | 怎么生效                   |\n| --- | ---------------------- | --- | ---------------------- |\n| C++ | 同一份 `fuyubot_plugin.h` | 4   | 同上（导出符号放 `extern \"C\"`） |","table":"table-3"},"411":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言   | 声明在哪                                                                                   | 值   | 怎么生效                                              |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| Rust | `fuyubot_plugin_api::SDK_ABI_VERSION`、`COMPATIBLE_HOST_ABI_VERSIONS`、`is_compatible()` | 4   | `define_plugin!` 把它填进 `PluginHandle::abi_version` |","table":"table-3"},"412":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言     | 声明在哪          | 值   | 怎么生效                                                              |\n| ------ | ------------- | --- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Python | **脚本不接触 ABI** | —   | 由中间插件 `fuyubot_python_host` 承载（标准 ABI v4 cdylib），`abi_version` 它填 |","table":"table-3"},"413":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言      | 声明在哪          | 值   | 怎么生效                      |\n| ------- | ------------- | --- | ------------------------- |\n| JS / TS | **脚本不接触 ABI** | —   | 同上，由 `fuyubot_js_host` 承载 |","table":"table-3"},"414":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"脚本插件走的是薄 SDK（`fuyubot.py` / `fuyubot.ts`）→ 原生桥 → 中间插件这条路，\n**作者永远不碰 C ABI**；ABI 版本由承载它的那份 cdylib 声明。Python 与 JS 的中间插件\n是同一套机制的两份实现，「两门语言对 ABI 的理解」不可能漂移。"},"415":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"`EventCallbackFn` 与 `MiddlewareCallbackFn` 都是 `unsafe extern \"C-unwind\" fn(...)`。\n`extern \"C\"` 边界上逃出去的 panic 会直接 **abort 整个进程**，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind`；\n`C-unwind` 允许 unwind 穿过边界，宿主就能接住、记一条日志、继续跑下一条更新。\n对 C/C++ 而言两者 ABI 完全一致；C++ 异常同样会穿过这个边界，**请自己在回调内处理完**。"},"416":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"`define_plugin!` 生成的三个导出函数还会把插件代码包在 `catch_unwind` 里——两层都要。"},"417":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"版本不兼容时宿主**不会**调 `plugin_stop`：那是对一个不认识的 ABI 下手。字段只增不改，\n新增一律追加在尾部；改动必须同时抬 `ABI_VERSION`。"},"418":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"page","content":"异步等待（await）","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async"},"419":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async","content":"Rust / JS / TS / Python 里可 await 的请求与更新等待"},"420":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"Rust：`ResponseRouter`"},"421":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"JS / TS：`invokeAsync` / `waitAsync`"},"422":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"Python：`run_async` + `invoke_async` / `wait_async`"},"423":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"托管路径：`fuyubot.py`"},"424":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"托管路径：`fuyubot.js`"},"425":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"选哪个"},"426":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#工具结果","content":"工具结果"},"427":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async","content":"`wait_for_update` 是**阻塞**原语：调用线程停下来等。要 JS `async/await` 那种语义，\n用下面这层**不阻塞**的封装——任务挂起，事件到了再唤醒。"},"428":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async","content":"> ⚠️ 这里有两套脚本 SDK，先确认你在哪一套：\n>\n> | 路径 | 入口 | 本文的 await |\n> | --- | --- | --- |\n> | `script_plugin!` 内嵌脚本（`fuyubot-sdk-script`） | `fuyubot_plugin.py` / `fuyubot_plugin.js` | ✅ 有 |\n> | `fuyubot-python-host` 托管脚本（`fuyubot-sdk-native`） | `fuyubot.py` | ✅ 有（`run_async`） |\n> | `fuyubot-js-host` 托管脚本（`fuyubot-sdk-native`） | `fuyubot.js` | ✅ 有（`runAsync`） |\n>\n> 选错文件会出现「方法不存在」——先看插件目录里拷的是哪一个。"},"429":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"`fuyubot-plugin-api` 从 ABI v4 起重导出 `ResponseRouter` / `ResponseFuture` / `UpdateFuture`："},"430":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"要点："},"431":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"**必须在插件自己的 executor 上 await**，别在宿主事件回调里 await（那是接收线程）。"},"432":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"`router.invoke*` 从插件自己的线程发请求时会用 scope service 把归属切回插件，\n响应不会丢；不需要手动 `scope_enter`。"},"433":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"取消 = `drop(fut)`；关闭 = drop router（所有 pending 立刻 `RouterClosed`）。"},"434":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"超时不内建，用 `tokio::time::timeout` 或你运行时的等价物。"},"435":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"`fuyubot_plugin.js`（`script_plugin!` 内嵌路径）在回调协议上包了 Promise："},"436":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"TDLib 业务错误（`@type: \"error\"`）也 **resolve**；只有宿主拒绝请求才 reject。"},"437":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"`waitAsync` 超时/取消返回 `null`。"},"438":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"老的 `invoke(..., onResponse)` / `waitForUpdate(..., onMatch)` 是底层/兼容 API。"},"439":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`fuyubot_plugin.py`（`script_plugin!` 内嵌路径）提供 asyncio 版，**不改老的 `run()`**："},"440":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`run_async` 建 asyncio 事件循环，后台线程读 stdin；`main` 在 `ready` 之后作为任务启动。"},"441":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`invoke_async` 的业务错误也 resolve，宿主拒绝请求才抛异常。"},"442":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`wait_async` 超时/取消返回 `None`。"},"443":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"**仍然可以用 `run()`**：同步循环、没有事件循环，`invoke_async` 会直接报错。"},"444":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"`fuyubot-python-host` 用 `uv run` 起的脚本，导入的是 `fuyubot.py`（ctypes 原生桥），\nAPI 名字一样，只是 `import` 不同："},"445":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"`run_async` 把原生桥的阻塞 `run()` 放到后台线程，主线程跑 asyncio 循环。"},"446":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"`invoke_async` 的回调从原生桥线程 `call_soon_threadsafe` 回事件循环。"},"447":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"`wait_async` 是**一次性** `on(\"update\", ...)` 订阅，命中/超时后自动退订；\n`timeout_ms=0` 表示一直等。"},"448":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"老的 `run()` / `invoke(..., on_response)` 原样保留。"},"449":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"`fuyubot-js-host` 用 `bun` 起的脚本，导入的是 `fuyubot.ts` / `fuyubot.js`："},"450":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"`runAsync` 把原生桥的 stdin 读取放后台线程，但**回调在主线程的 `step()` 里分发**\n（bun 的 JSCallback 不能跨线程调用）；`main` 与 step 循环并行跑。"},"451":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"`invokeAsync` 仍走 `invoke` 的 request/response 配对；`waitAsync` 是一次性\n`on(\"update\", ...)`，超时/命中后自动退订。"},"452":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"老的 `run()` / `invoke(..., onResponse)` 原样保留。"},"453":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景                  | 用什么                   |\n| ------------------- | --------------------- |\n| 同步代码 / 宿主内部 / 登录状态机 | `wait_for_update`（阻塞） |","table":"table-0"},"454":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景                         | 用什么                     |\n| -------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| Rust 插件、有 tokio 等 executor | `ResponseRouter`（await） |","table":"table-0"},"455":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景         | 用什么                         |\n| ---------- | --------------------------- |\n| JS/TS 内嵌脚本 | `invokeAsync` / `waitAsync` |","table":"table-0"},"456":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景          | 用什么                                         |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Python 内嵌脚本 | `run_async` + `invoke_async` / `wait_async` |","table":"table-0"},"457":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景                           | 用什么                                         |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Python 托管脚本（`fuyubot.py`，uv） | `run_async` + `invoke_async` / `wait_async` |","table":"table-0"},"458":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景                        | 用什么                                      |\n| ------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| JS 托管脚本（`fuyubot.js`，bun） | `runAsync` + `invokeAsync` / `waitAsync` |","table":"table-0"},"459":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景           | 用什么                 |\n| ------------ | ------------------- |\n| C / C++ / Go | 回调 `on`（语言没有 await） |","table":"table-0"},"460":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#工具结果","content":"工具调用没有“等响应”这一层：ABI v4 的 `call_tool_result` / `callTool` 是**同步**返回结果的。\n详见 工具与中间件。"},"461":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"page","content":"订阅与事件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events"},"462":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events","content":"on/off/emit、过滤器、双通道与归属"},"463":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"双通道：具体 `@type` 与兜底 `update`"},"464":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"过滤器"},"465":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"归属：`emit` 不是广播"},"466":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#rust","content":"Rust"},"467":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#python--js薄-sdk","content":"Python / JS（薄 SDK）"},"468":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events","content":"事件总线是插件拿到 TDLib 更新的唯一入口，也是插件之间说话的方式。三个动作：\n`on` 订阅（返回句柄）、`off` 退订（或让句柄 drop）、`emit` 发自定义事件。"},"469":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"每条更新会被**同时**发到两条通道上："},"470":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道                                | 谁收         | 什么时候用    |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------- | -------- |\n| 具体的 `@type`（`updateNewMessage` 等） | 精确订阅了它的监听器 | 你只关心一种更新 |","table":"table-0"},"471":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道         | 谁收           | 什么时候用                 |\n| ---------- | ------------ | --------------------- |\n| `\"update\"` | 订阅兜底通道的所有监听器 | 你要看全部，或不想追 TDLib 的类型名 |","table":"table-0"},"472":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道           | 谁收               | 什么时候用              |\n| ------------ | ---------------- | ------------------ |\n| `\"response\"` | **只发给发起那个请求的插件** | 收 `td_invoke*` 的结果 |","table":"table-0"},"473":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"`\"update\"` 与 `\"response\"` 是 ABI 常量（`UPDATE_EVENT` / `RESPONSE_EVENT`），别自己拼字符串。"},"474":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"`on` 的第三个参数是一份过滤器 JSON：**点分路径 → 期望值**。"},"475":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则                       | 说明                                                                |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `event_type` 键只用来**选通道** | `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":5}` 表示等 5 号响应；它**不参与负载匹配** |","table":"table-1"},"476":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则           | 说明                                                            |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 其余键做负载字段相等匹配 | 字段位置随更新类型变：`updateNewMessage` 的 `chat_id` 在 `message.chat_id` |","table":"table-1"},"477":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则              | 说明    |\n| --------------- | ----- |\n| 空 / `null` / 不传 | 该通道全收 |","table":"table-1"},"478":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"同一个事件可以订阅**多次**、各带各的过滤器。脚本侧按订阅号 `handle` 分发，所以不该响的回调不会响。"},"479":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"插件里调 `emit` 走的是 `emit_scoped(自己, …)`：只送给**该插件自己 + 全局订阅者**。\n归属的语义是「**额外定向**」而不是「排除广播」——宿主 `emit` 的更新照旧发给所有订阅者，\n`emit_scoped(owner, …)` 只是在那份收件人之外**再加**上 `owner` 自己的订阅。"},"480":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发             | 谁收得到     |\n| -------------- | -------- |\n| 宿主发更新 / `emit` | 所有匹配的订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"481":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发                | 谁收得到              |\n| ----------------- | ----------------- |\n| 插件 `emit(\"x\", …)` | 该插件自己的订阅者 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"482":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发    | 谁收得到                                       |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 宿主的响应 | `emit_scoped(发起者, \"response\", …)`：全局 + 发起者 |","table":"table-2"},"483":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"要让别的插件收到你的事件，**让对方订阅全局事件**，不要指望你的 `emit` 是一次广播。"},"484":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"订阅句柄必须活着。Rust 侧 `HostExt::subscribe_json` 返回的是 `#[must_use]` 的\n`Subscription`，**drop 就是退订**；`let _ = …` 会立刻退订。插件卸载时宿主还会整批回滚，\n但那已经是另一回事了。"},"485":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#rust","content":"回调用 `extern \"C-unwind\" fn(user_data, payload) -> i32`，返回 `0` 表示成功；`payload` 是宿主临时的\nNUL 结尾字符串，要留就当场拷走（`parse_payload` 已经替你解析成 `serde_json::Value`）。"},"486":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#python--js薄-sdk","content":"脚本侧的订阅**没有退订接口**——注册后一直有效，随插件停止一起撤。\n方法的逐个说明见 Python 插件 / JS 与 TS 插件。"},"487":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#python--js薄-sdk","content":"要按固定次数等一条更新（阻塞式），用 `wait_for_update`，见 调用 TDLib。\n要改流经管线的负载，用中间件，见 工具与中间件。"},"488":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"page","content":"Go 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go"},"489":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"cgo 编 c-shared，逻辑用 Go 写、ABI 用一层 C 薄壳"},"490":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"结构：Go 写逻辑，C 写壳"},"491":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"编译"},"492":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"一个宿主行为要记住：Go 库不会被卸载"},"493":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#验证","content":"验证"},"494":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"相关"},"495":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"Go 也能写插件：`go build -buildmode=c-shared` 出来的就是标准动态库，宿主只要看到四个导出符号\n就认它。完整可跑的示例在 `examples/go-ping`。"},"496":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"目前**没有** `fuyubot-sdk init --lang go` 模板——Go 这条路线是「自己搭工程」：\n抄 `examples/go-ping`，或者照下面这两段写。C 头文件仍然用\n`fuyubot-sdk codegen --lang c --dir <工程目录>` 生成，不要手抄。"},"497":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件        | 作用                               |\n| --------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `main.go` | 逻辑：解析更新 JSON、拼 `sendMessage`、打日志 |","table":"table-0"},"498":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件         | 作用                                                                              |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin.c` | 四个 ABI 符号：`plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_free_string` |","table":"table-0"},"499":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件                 | 作用                                 |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_plugin.h` | 生成物（`codegen --lang c` 落的），**不提交** |","table":"table-0"},"500":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"为什么不直接 `//export plugin_init`：`PluginHandle` 是**按值返回**的结构体，由 C 侧构造最稳；\n也避免把宿主 VTable 的函数指针搬进 Go。C 侧只做转发："},"501":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"Go 侧通过两个 C 小桥访问宿主（这样 Go 里不用碰函数指针）："},"502":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"`fy_log` / `fy_invoke` 在 `plugin.c` 里实现，就是 `g_host->log` / `g_host->td_invoke_simplified` 的转发。"},"503":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"cgo 需要 C 编译器：Linux / macOS 用 `cc`，Windows 用 mingw-w64（如\nw64devkit）。"},"504":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"Windows 上没装 mingw 时报 `gcc: executable file not found` 或\n`cannot open file 'mingwex.lib'`——那是缺 C 工具链，不是插件代码的问题。\nMSVC 的 `cl` 不能直接给 cgo 用（Go 的 Windows 外部链接器要 GCC 那一套）。"},"505":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"Go 的 `c-shared` 运行时有线程与信号处理器，`FreeLibrary` / `dlclose` 之后进程会直接\naccess violation（`0xC0000005`）。"},"506":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"所以 `fuyubot-loader` 会识别 Go 产物（文件里的 `\\xff Go buildinf:` 魔数），\n**故意不卸载**这类库：`plugin_stop` 照跑、注册照回滚，只是那几 MB 库内存留到进程退出。\n普通 Rust / C / C++ 插件不受影响，仍是 drop 即卸载。"},"507":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"这也意味着：**别在同一个进程里反复加载同一个 Go 插件**（热重载路径别指望它）。\n先 `fuyubot stop` 再 `run`，行为是干净的。"},"508":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#验证","content":"回放输出里应能看到 `go-ping 插件：回了 pong` 和一条\n`sendMessage {\"chat_id\":…,\"input_message_content\":{\"@type\":\"inputMessageText\",…}}`。"},"509":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"ABI 细节（2 个 u32 + `host_ctx` + 19 个函数指针、内存所有权、版本协商）：ABI 契约"},"510":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"C / C++ 的写法（同一份头文件）：C 与 C++ 插件"},"511":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"订阅与过滤器：订阅与事件"},"512":{"id":"/docs/plugin","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"page","content":"插件总览","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin"},"513":{"id":"/docs/plugin-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"原生插件（一个 cdylib）与脚本插件（一个目录），以及四种导出符号"},"514":{"id":"/docs/plugin-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件四个导出符号","content":"原生插件：四个导出符号"},"515":{"id":"/docs/plugin-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"最小闭环（原生插件）"},"516":{"id":"/docs/plugin-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"写原生插件要知道的六件事"},"517":{"id":"/docs/plugin-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"按语言看"},"518":{"id":"/docs/plugin-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"按能力看"},"519":{"id":"/docs/plugin-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"插件名与目录"},"520":{"id":"/docs/plugin-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"**插件有两种形态**，按需求选："},"521":{"id":"/docs/plugin-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件           | 脚本插件             |\n| --- | -------------- | ---------------- |\n| 语言  | Rust / C / C++ | Python / JS / TS |","table":"table-0"},"522":{"id":"/docs/plugin-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件                                 | 脚本插件                        |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------- |\n| 形态  | 一个 cdylib（`.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`） | 一个目录（manifest + 脚本 + 薄 SDK） |","table":"table-0"},"523":{"id":"/docs/plugin-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件              | 脚本插件         |\n| --- | ----------------- | ------------ |\n| 边界  | 与宿主同进程，C ABI 函数调用 | 一个脚本一个解释器子进程 |","table":"table-0"},"524":{"id":"/docs/plugin-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件 | 脚本插件          |\n| --- | ---- | ------------- |\n| 崩溃  | 拖垮宿主 | 只有子进程死，宿主记一条错 |","table":"table-0"},"525":{"id":"/docs/plugin-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|      | 原生插件        | 脚本插件    |\n| ---- | ----------- | ------- |\n| 要编译吗 | 要（用你自己的工具链） | 不要，装上就跑 |","table":"table-0"},"526":{"id":"/docs/plugin-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件                                | 脚本插件   |\n| --- | ----------------------------------- | ------ |\n| 起步  | `fuyubot-sdk init demo --lang rust` | 看 脚本插件 |","table":"table-0"},"527":{"id":"/docs/plugin-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"**只想写脚本？** 看 脚本插件：一个目录就是一个插件，\n不编译、不碰 ABI，`fuyubot plugin install` 装上就跑。"},"528":{"id":"/docs/plugin-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件四个导出符号","content":"一个原生插件 = 一个 cdylib。宿主 `dlopen` 它，只认四个导出符号，\n其余全部能力都经 `HostApiVTable` 回调宿主。插件不认识 Rust 内核，也不需要认识。"},"529":{"id":"/docs/plugin-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件四个导出符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 干什么                                               |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 校验 VTable、构造插件状态；返回失败句柄（`abi_version == 0`）= 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-1"},"530":{"id":"/docs/plugin-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件四个导出符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 干什么                       |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 拿到配置 JSON，注册订阅 / 工具 / 中间件 |","table":"table-1"},"531":{"id":"/docs/plugin-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件四个导出符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 干什么            |\n| ------------- | --- | -------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 卸载前调一次，回收自己的状态 |","table":"table-1"},"532":{"id":"/docs/plugin-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件四个导出符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 干什么                               |\n| -------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 释放**插件自己**分配的字符串（宿主从不 free 插件的指针） |","table":"table-1"},"533":{"id":"/docs/plugin-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件四个导出符号","content":"契约细节（字段布局、内存所有权、版本协商）见 ABI 契约。"},"534":{"id":"/docs/plugin-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"`fuyubot init` 重复执行会被挡住（不覆盖你改过的配置）；三个键都有默认值，最简可以只有 `[bot]`。"},"535":{"id":"/docs/plugin-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"插件名只允许字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`（会拼进源码与 TOML）；目录名里的 `.` / `-` 换成 `_` 当 crate 名\n（`fuyubot.weather` → `fuyubot_weather`）。"},"536":{"id":"/docs/plugin-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"**产物落在哪**：`plugin install <工程目录>` 只看 `<工程>/target/{release,debug}` 与工程目录本身。\n插件若是**当前 workspace 的成员**，`cargo build -p <crate>` 默认把产物放在仓库根的 `target/`，于是它找不到\n——加 `--target-dir <工程目录>/target`，或直接指着产物装。"},"537":{"id":"/docs/plugin-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"**SDK 走源码开发时**设 `FUYUBOT_SDK_PATH` 指向 FuyuBot-SDK 仓库的 `crates/`，生成的插件会写 `path = \"…\"`；\n不设就写 crates.io 版本号。"},"538":{"id":"/docs/plugin-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"`fuyubot` 管运行，`fuyubot-sdk` 管开发，**两个都不编译插件**：编译是作者自己语言工具链的事\n（`cargo build` / `cl /LD` / `gcc -shared`）。`fuyubot plugin install` 只**复制**已编好的产物。"},"539":{"id":"/docs/plugin-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事                       | 说明                                                              |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回调是 `extern \"C-unwind\"` | 用 `extern \"C\"` 的话，逃出去的 panic 直接 abort 整个进程，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind` |","table":"table-2"},"540":{"id":"/docs/plugin-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事                               | 说明                        |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 一个 crate 只展开一次 `define_plugin!` | 四个符号名是 ABI 定死的，展开两次就是重复定义 |","table":"table-2"},"541":{"id":"/docs/plugin-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事             | 说明                                         |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| ABI 版本目前是 `3` | 不匹配时宿主**拒绝加载**，而且**不能**调 `plugin_stop` 收状态 |","table":"table-2"},"542":{"id":"/docs/plugin-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事        | 说明                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| 订阅句柄必须活着 | Rust 侧是 `#[must_use]` 的守卫，drop 就是退订 |","table":"table-2"},"543":{"id":"/docs/plugin-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事              | 说明                                         |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 插件 `emit` 不是广播 | 只送**自己 + 全局订阅者**（`emit_scoped`），影响别的插件要靠订阅 |","table":"table-2"},"544":{"id":"/docs/plugin-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事      | 说明                                       |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 谁分配谁释放 | 宿主绝不 free 插件的指针；宿主给的字符串是线程局部缓冲，下次宿主调用前有效 |","table":"table-2"},"545":{"id":"/docs/plugin-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Rust 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rust/\" />"},"546":{"id":"/docs/plugin-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"C 与 C++ 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/native/\" />"},"547":{"id":"/docs/plugin-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Go 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/go/\" />"},"548":{"id":"/docs/plugin-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Python 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/python/\" />"},"549":{"id":"/docs/plugin-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"JS 与 TypeScript 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/js-ts/\" />"},"550":{"id":"/docs/plugin-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"订阅与事件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/events/\" />"},"551":{"id":"/docs/plugin-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"调用 TDLib\" href=\"/docs/plugin/tdlib/\" />"},"552":{"id":"/docs/plugin-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"富消息\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rich/\" />"},"553":{"id":"/docs/plugin-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"工具与中间件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/tools/\" />"},"554":{"id":"/docs/plugin-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"ABI 契约\" href=\"/docs/plugin/abi/\" />"},"555":{"id":"/docs/plugin-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"调试与安装\" href=\"/docs/plugin/testing/\" />"},"556":{"id":"/docs/plugin-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"插件名只允许字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`（它会拼进源码和 TOML）；目录名里的 `.` / `-` 换成 `_` 当 crate 名\n（`fuyubot.weather` → `fuyubot_weather`）。"},"557":{"id":"/docs/plugin-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"**原生插件名只有 dlopen 之后才知道**：它来自 `plugin_init` 返回的 `PluginHandle`，所以\n`fuyubot plugin list` 会真的加载一次再看名字。"},"558":{"id":"/docs/plugin-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"**脚本插件的身份在 manifest 里**（Python 的 `[tool.fuyubot]` / JS 的 `\"fuyubot\"` 段），\n目录名是装卸载的单位（`fuyubot plugin install|uninstall <目录>`），见 脚本插件。"},"559":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"page","content":"JS 与 TypeScript 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts"},"560":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"薄 SDK 全部方法的用法、事件怎么触发、可抄的例子"},"561":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"562":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"563":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么触发"},"564":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"`on` — 订阅事件"},"565":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` — 调 TDLib 接口"},"566":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#emit--发自定义事件","content":"`emit` — 发自定义事件"},"567":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#log--打日志","content":"`log` — 打日志"},"568":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#registertool--登记工具","content":"`registerTool` — 登记工具"},"569":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#usemiddleware--挂中间件","content":"`useMiddleware` — 挂中间件"},"570":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#run--启动","content":"`run` — 启动"},"571":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"完整示例"},"572":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"573":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"JS / TS 插件就是一个目录：`package.json` 写身份，入口文件写逻辑，`fuyubot.ts`（单文件薄 SDK）\n管通信。运行时是 bun，**TS 不需要 `tsc`**。上手三步见\n脚本插件。本页是**方法手册 + 示例**。"},"574":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"本页讲托管路径的 `fuyubot.js` / `fuyubot.ts`（`fuyubot-js-host`），它也支持\n`runAsync` / `invokeAsync` / `waitAsync`。`script_plugin!` 内嵌的\n`fuyubot_plugin.js` 有同名 API，见 异步等待。"},"575":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"manifest 长这样（`entry` 不写就默认 `index.ts`）："},"576":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                            | 干什么             |\n| ----------------------------- | --------------- |\n| `on(event, handler, filter?)` | 订阅事件：事件来了就调你的函数 |","table":"table-0"},"577":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                     | 干什么                     |\n| -------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `invoke(method, params?, onResponse?)` | 调一次 TDLib 接口（发消息、取资料……） |","table":"table-0"},"578":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                      | 干什么      |\n| ----------------------- | -------- |\n| `emit(event, payload?)` | 发一条自定义事件 |","table":"table-0"},"579":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                             | 干什么 |\n| ------------------------------ | --- |\n| `log(message, level = \"info\")` | 打日志 |","table":"table-0"},"580":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                   | 干什么    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `registerTool(name, description = \"\", inputSchema?)` | 登记一个工具 |","table":"table-0"},"581":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                              | 干什么    |\n| ------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `useMiddleware(stage, handler)` | 挂一个中间件 |","table":"table-0"},"582":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法               | 干什么                                                |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `pluginConfig()` | **同步**读**自己**那一段配置（`[plugin.<插件名>]`）；`run()` 之前也能用 |","table":"table-0"},"583":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                    | 干什么                           |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `getConfig(section, key?, onConfig?)` | 读**任意**插件段（异步，回调在 `run()` 之后） |","table":"table-0"},"584":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                               | 干什么                                |\n| -------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `setConfig(key, value, onDone?)` | 写**自己**那一段配置（成功后回写 `fuyubot.toml`） |","table":"table-0"},"585":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 干什么                   |\n| ------- | --------------------- |\n| `run()` | 握手并开始收事件——**永远是最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"586":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"`fuyubot.toml` 里每个插件有自己的段（见配置文件）。读**自己**那段\n用 `pluginConfig()`——它是**同步**的，宿主在启动脚本时就把这段塞进了 `argv[2]`，所以\n`run()` 之前（模块顶层）就能用："},"587":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"**读别人的段**（`getConfig`）是**异步**的：回执要等 `run()` 之后才有，所以只能在事件/中间件\n回调里用。段或键不存在时回调收到 `null`。"},"588":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"**写自己的段**（`setConfig`）也是异步的，成功后 `onDone(true)`，宿主会**回写\n`fuyubot.toml`**。⚠️ 回写是**全量重写**，你手写的注释会丢。"},"589":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"写失败（越权 / 值不是合法 JSON / 写盘失败）时宿主只发一条 error 日志、**不会**调 `onDone`\n——别把「没收到回调」当成成功。"},"590":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"脚本插件只能写**自己**的段：`setConfig` 没有 section 参数，宿主按调用者身份判定归属，\n所以改不到别的插件那一段（会被拒）。这是 ABI 层面的硬约束，不是薄 SDK 的限制。"},"591":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"你的函数只有**被事件触发**才会跑。事件有两个来源："},"592":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"**TDLib 更新**：来一条消息、消息发送成功……每种更新是一个事件，**事件名就是更新的 `@type`**\n（`updateNewMessage`、`updateMessageSendSucceeded` ……）。每条更新会同时发到两个通道：\n具体的 `@type` 事件，和兜底的 `\"update\"` 事件（订阅它可以看全部）。"},"593":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"**你自己发的事件**：`emit(\"job_done\", …)` 发出的自定义事件（细节见\n订阅与事件）。"},"594":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数      | 说明                                       |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `event` | 事件名：更新的 `@type`、`\"update\"`（全部更新）或你自定义的名字 |","table":"table-1"},"595":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数        | 说明                                |\n| --------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `handler` | 回调函数，收到一个 `payload`（解析好的对象，直接取字段） |","table":"table-1"},"596":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数       | 说明                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `filter` | 可选。只收负载里**指定字段等于指定值**的事件（点分路径写法，见下） |","table":"table-1"},"597":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"同一个事件可以订阅多次，各带各的过滤器。"},"598":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"**过滤器**：`{ \"点分路径\": 期望值 }`，负载里那个字段**等于**期望值才触发："},"599":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"发一个 TDLib 请求。方法名与参数名**以 TDLib 为准**（不是 Bot API），查法见\n调用 TDLib。给了 `onResponse` 时回调按 `request_id` **自动配对**，\n不用自己记请求号。"},"600":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"**`_` 就是 `\"@type\"`**：`params` 里嵌的 TDLib 对象都可以把判别字段写成 `_`，\n薄 SDK 会在发往宿主之前**递归**换回 `\"@type\"`——嵌套多深、数组里的对象都算。\n两种写法等价，同时写了两个时以 `\"@type\"` 为准："},"601":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"这一层只在 JS / TS 薄 SDK 里做（宿主不会替你补判别字段），而且只作用于要发给\nTDLib 的东西：`emit` 的自定义负载、`callTool` 的参数不过这一步，那里的 `_`\n就是个普通字段。"},"602":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` **不阻塞**、立即返回。响应回来时你的 `onResponse` 被调用。\n不传 `onResponse` 就是「发完不管」。"},"603":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#emit--发自定义事件","content":"给**自己 + 全局订阅者**发一条自定义事件（不是广播给所有插件，见 订阅与事件）。\n适合在自己内部做「任务完成」之类的信号："},"604":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#log--打日志","content":"`level`：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace`。排查问题时把配置里\n`[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`（见配置文件）。"},"605":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#registertool--登记工具","content":"只登记**元数据**（名字、说明、参数的 JSON Schema），让宿主知道有这个工具；\n调用分发看 工具与中间件。"},"606":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#usemiddleware--挂中间件","content":"`handler(stage, payload)` 在更新流经管线时被调用，可以检查或改写负载。\n`stage` 是阶段号；细节看 工具与中间件。"},"607":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#run--启动","content":"发就绪握手、开始收事件，**阻塞到进程结束**。**必须是最后一行**——它提前返回 = 插件加载失败。"},"608":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**Echo 机器人**——回声复读："},"609":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**——不同命令各干各的："},"610":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**按聊天计数**——记住状态："},"611":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**原生桥**：薄 SDK 要加载原生桥（和托管插件同一份库）。查找顺序：脚本同目录 →\n环境变量 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` → 当前工作目录。找不到会报\n「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」，排法见 脚本插件常见问题。"},"612":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**自检**：`bun fuyubot.ts` 验证 API 形状（不碰宿主），输出 `fuyubot: self-test ok`。"},"613":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**依赖工具**：要装 bun（机器人用 `bun install` 装依赖、`bun` 起脚本）。"},"614":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**payload 取字段**：JS 侧没有 schema，先判空或 `as any` 再取；\n`updateNewMessage` 的文本在 `message.content.text.text`。"},"615":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"page","content":"C 与 C++ 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native"},"616":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"同一份头文件、extern \"C\"、用你自己的工具链编译"},"617":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#四个符号","content":"四个符号"},"618":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"C"},"619":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"C++"},"620":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编译（你自己的工具链）"},"621":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"622":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"注意"},"623":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C 与 C++ 用**同一份头文件** `fuyubot_plugin.h`，差别只有两条：导出符号要不要放进 `extern \"C\"`，\n以及用什么拼 JSON。头文件是**产物**，不是源码——它由 cbindgen 从 Rust 定义生成，\n用 `fuyubot-sdk codegen` 落盘，别手改（改了下次就被覆盖）。"},"624":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C / C++ / Go 没有 async 运行时：请求与更新用回调（`on`），工具结果用\n`call_tool_result` 同步拿。可 await 的版本只在 Rust / JS / TS / Python 的脚本 SDK 里，\n见 异步等待。"},"625":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#四个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 说明                                                           |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 比 `host->version != ABI_VERSION`，存下 VTable，返回 `PluginHandle` |","table":"table-0"},"626":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#四个符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| -------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 订阅/注册；返回 `0` 表示成功 |","table":"table-0"},"627":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#四个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| ------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 清状态；只登记元数据的插件可以不写 |","table":"table-0"},"628":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#四个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 说明                         |\n| -------------------- | ------ | -------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 本插件不往外送字符串时也得有个空实现（宿主可能调它） |","table":"table-0"},"629":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#四个符号","content":"`PluginHandle` 的判据是「`abi_version != 0` **且** `context` 非空」，所以 `context` 不能给 `NULL`。\n版本不对就返回全零句柄，宿主会把它当成拒绝加载。"},"630":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"`ABI_VERSION` 与 `FUYUBOT_EXPORT` 都来自头文件，不要自己写死。"},"631":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"同 C，**唯一的硬差别**是四个导出符号必须在 `extern \"C\"` 里——C++ 会改函数名（mangling），\n宿主按 ABI 定死的名字 `dlsym`，改了就找不到。"},"632":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"`C-unwind` 对 C/C++ 而言与普通 C 调用**ABI 一致**，但 C++ 的异常照样能穿过这个边界——\n逃到宿主那边的异常是未定义行为。**在回调内部把异常处理完再返回**。"},"633":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"`/utf-8` 省掉的后果很难看：中文注释被按系统代码页拆坏，编译器报的是「注释提前结束、后面全是语法错误」。"},"634":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编完装进插件目录："},"635":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"每个插件在 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下有自己的一段配置（见配置文件）。\nC 侧直接调 VTable 上那两个函数："},"636":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"两点与其它函数一致：**返回值是宿主线程局部缓冲**（读完即弃，别 free）；`set_config`\n**没有 section 参数**——宿主按调用者身份判定，所以插件无法伪造写别人的段。"},"637":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"模板里的 JSON 取值是**朴素查找**（`strstr`），不处理转义、不处理同名嵌套键；认真写就引一个 JSON 库。"},"638":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"宿主返回的字符串是**线程局部缓冲**，只在下一次宿主调用之前有效——当场拷走，并且**不要试图释放它**。"},"639":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"`set_config` 回写是**全量重写** `fuyubot.toml`，手写注释会丢（见上面「读 / 写配置」）。"},"640":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"想少拼 JSON，可以只发 `td_invoke_simplified` 需要的参数对象（`@type` 由宿主补），见 调用 TDLib。"},"641":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"page","content":"Python 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python"},"642":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"薄 SDK 全部方法的用法、事件怎么触发、可抄的例子"},"643":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"644":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"645":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么触发"},"646":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"`on` — 订阅事件"},"647":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` — 调 TDLib 接口"},"648":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#emit--发自定义事件","content":"`emit` — 发自定义事件"},"649":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#log--打日志","content":"`log` — 打日志"},"650":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#register_tool--登记工具","content":"`register_tool` — 登记工具"},"651":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#use_middleware--挂中间件","content":"`use_middleware` — 挂中间件"},"652":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#run--启动","content":"`run` — 启动"},"653":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"完整示例"},"654":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"655":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"Python 插件就是一个目录：`pyproject.toml` 写身份，`main.py` 写逻辑，`fuyubot.py`（单文件薄 SDK）\n管通信。上手三步见 脚本插件。本页是**方法手册 + 示例**。"},"656":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"本页的 `fuyubot.py`（`fuyubot-python-host`）和 `script_plugin!` 内嵌的\n`fuyubot_plugin.py` 都支持 `run_async` / `invoke_async` / `wait_async`，\n见 异步等待。"},"657":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"manifest 长这样（`entry` 不写就默认 `main.py`）："},"658":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                | 干什么             |\n| --------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| `on(event, handler, filter=None)` | 订阅事件：事件来了就调你的函数 |","table":"table-0"},"659":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                              | 干什么                     |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `invoke(method, params=None, on_response=None)` | 调一次 TDLib 接口（发消息、取资料……） |","table":"table-0"},"660":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                          | 干什么      |\n| --------------------------- | -------- |\n| `emit(event, payload=None)` | 发一条自定义事件 |","table":"table-0"},"661":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                           | 干什么 |\n| ---------------------------- | --- |\n| `log(message, level=\"info\")` | 打日志 |","table":"table-0"},"662":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                       | 干什么    |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `register_tool(name, description=\"\", input_schema=None)` | 登记一个工具 |","table":"table-0"},"663":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                               | 干什么    |\n| -------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `use_middleware(stage, handler)` | 挂一个中间件 |","table":"table-0"},"664":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                | 干什么                                                |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_config()` | **同步**读**自己**那一段配置（`[plugin.<插件名>]`）；`run()` 之前也能用 |","table":"table-0"},"665":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                            | 干什么                           |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `get_config(section, key=\"\", on_config=None)` | 读**任意**插件段（异步，回调在 `run()` 之后） |","table":"table-0"},"666":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                     | 干什么                                |\n| -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `set_config(key, value, on_done=None)` | 写**自己**那一段配置（成功后回写 `fuyubot.toml`） |","table":"table-0"},"667":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 干什么                   |\n| ------- | --------------------- |\n| `run()` | 握手并开始收事件——**永远是最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"668":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"`fuyubot.toml` 里每个插件有自己的段（见配置文件）。读**自己**那段\n用 `plugin_config()`——它是**同步**的，宿主在启动脚本时就把这段塞进了 `argv[2]`，所以\n`run()` 之前（模块顶层）就能用："},"669":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"**读别人的段**（`get_config`）是**异步**的：回执要等 `run()` 之后才有，所以只能在事件/中间件\n回调里用。段或键不存在时回调收到 `None`。"},"670":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"**写自己的段**（`set_config`）也是异步的，成功后 `on_done(True)`，宿主会**回写\n`fuyubot.toml`**。⚠️ 回写是**全量重写**，你手写的注释会丢。"},"671":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"写失败（越权 / 值不是合法 JSON / 写盘失败）时宿主只发一条 error 日志、**不会**调 `on_done`\n——别把「没收到回调」当成成功。"},"672":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"脚本插件只能写**自己**的段：`set_config` 没有 section 参数，宿主按调用者身份判定归属，\n所以改不到别的插件那一段（会被拒）。这是 ABI 层面的硬约束，不是薄 SDK 的限制。"},"673":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"你的函数只有**被事件触发**才会跑。事件有两个来源："},"674":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"**TDLib 更新**：来一条消息、消息发送成功……每种更新是一个事件，**事件名就是更新的 `@type`**\n（`updateNewMessage`、`updateMessageSendSucceeded` ……）。每条更新会同时发到两个通道：\n具体的 `@type` 事件，和兜底的 `\"update\"` 事件（订阅它可以看全部）。"},"675":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"**你自己发的事件**：`emit(\"job_done\", …)` 发出的自定义事件（细节见\n订阅与事件）。"},"676":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数      | 说明                                       |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `event` | 事件名：更新的 `@type`、`\"update\"`（全部更新）或你自定义的名字 |","table":"table-1"},"677":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数        | 说明                                     |\n| --------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `handler` | 回调函数，收到一个 `payload`（解析好的 `dict`，直接取字段） |","table":"table-1"},"678":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数       | 说明                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `filter` | 可选。只收负载里**指定字段等于指定值**的事件（点分路径写法，见下） |","table":"table-1"},"679":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"**是两参数函数，不是装饰器**——`@on(...)` 会报错，老老实实 `on(事件, 函数)`。\n同一个事件可以订阅多次，各带各的过滤器。"},"680":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"**过滤器**：`{\"点分路径\": 期望值}`，负载里那个字段**等于**期望值才触发："},"681":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"发一个 TDLib 请求。方法名与参数名**以 TDLib 为准**（不是 Bot API），查法见\n调用 TDLib。给了 `on_response` 时回调按 `request_id` **自动配对**，\n不用自己记请求号。"},"682":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` **不阻塞**、立即返回。响应回来时你的 `on_response` 被调用。\n不传 `on_response` 就是「发完不管」。"},"683":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#emit--发自定义事件","content":"给**自己 + 全局订阅者**发一条自定义事件（不是广播给所有插件，见 订阅与事件）。\n适合在自己内部做「任务完成」之类的信号："},"684":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#log--打日志","content":"`level`：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace`。排查问题时把配置里\n`[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`（见配置文件）。"},"685":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#register_tool--登记工具","content":"只登记**元数据**（名字、说明、参数的 JSON Schema），让宿主知道有这个工具；\n调用分发看 工具与中间件。"},"686":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#use_middleware--挂中间件","content":"`handler(stage, payload)` 在更新流经管线时被调用，可以检查或改写负载。\n`stage` 是阶段号；细节看 工具与中间件。"},"687":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#run--启动","content":"发就绪握手、开始收事件，**阻塞到进程结束**。**必须是最后一行**——它提前返回 = 插件加载失败。"},"688":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**Echo 机器人**——回声复读："},"689":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**——不同命令各干各的："},"690":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**看全部流量**——兜底通道记日志："},"691":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**原生桥**：薄 SDK 要加载原生桥（和托管插件同一份库）。查找顺序：脚本同目录 →\n环境变量 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` → 当前工作目录。找不到会报\n「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」，排法见 脚本插件常见问题。"},"692":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**自检**：`python fuyubot.py` 验证 API 形状（不碰宿主），输出 `fuyubot: self-test ok`。"},"693":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**依赖工具**：要装 uv（机器人用 `uv sync` 装依赖、`uv run` 起脚本）。"},"694":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**payload 取字段**：先判空再取（`dict.get()`），不同更新类型的字段位置不一样；\n`updateNewMessage` 的文本在 `message.content.text.text`。"},"695":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"page","content":"富消息","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich"},"696":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"messageRichMessage：块树排版、按钮行与本地 Markdown 转换"},"697":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"三种源"},"698":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"发送与编辑"},"699":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮"},"700":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"行内富文本：`richtext`"},"701":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"覆盖靠测试钉着"},"702":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 的富消息（`messageRichMessage`）是「一页排版」的消息：标题、段落、表格、代码块、\n按钮行……全是一块一块的**页块**（`InputPageBlock`），行内另有独立的富文本（`RichText`）。\nBot API 管它叫 Rich Messages。"},"703":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 里**没有** `sendRichMessage` / `editRichMessage`，也没有自带的 md → 块树转换；\n`fuyubot-simplify` 的 `RichMessage` 把这层补齐了：发送 / 编辑就是\n`sendMessage` / `editMessageText` + `inputMessageRichMessage`，Markdown 转换在**本地**完成。"},"704":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"`RichMessage` 内部是 `RichSource` 三选一："},"705":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                               | 谁解析                              | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | -------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_markdown(md)` | **本地**转换器（对齐官方 Rich Markdown 全表） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"706":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                                 | 谁解析                                | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_blocks(blocks)` | 你给现成块树（每块一条 `InputPageBlock` JSON） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"707":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源        | 构造                                 | 谁解析              | 谁能发   |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------- | ---------------- | ----- |\n| Markdown | `RichMessage::server_markdown(md)` | **服务端**（发前拿不到块树） | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"708":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源    | 构造                               | 谁解析     | 谁能发   |\n| ---- | -------------------------------- | ------- | ----- |\n| Html | `RichMessage::server_html(html)` | **服务端** | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"709":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"本地转换器对着官方 Rich Markdown 表\n一类一例全覆盖：标题 / 段落 / 围栏代码（含 `math`）/ 引用与可展开引用 / 拉引 / 页脚 /\n列表与任务项 / 表格 / 分割线 / 公式 / 折叠块 / 拼贴与幻灯片 / 媒体（按扩展名猜类型）/\n地图 / 锚点 / 按钮行 / 思考占位 / 脚注；行内粗斜删码、标记、剧透、上下标、行内公式、\n自定义 emoji、时间、`mailto:` / `tel:` / `tg://user` / 锚点链接，以及那批 HTML 标签\n（`<u>` `<details>` `<tg-collage>` `<tg-button-row>` …）。**不认的一律当普通文本**\n（引用式链接、`<table>` 这类 HTML 块不会报错，只是原样保留）。"},"710":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"参数是 `RichMessageParams`——与 `SendMessageParams` **分开的类型**（那边是「文本 + 媒体」\n二选一，混在一起互斥规则没人记得住）：`message` / `reply_to_message_id` / `topic_id`\n（`Option<Topic>`，见Simplify 封装）/ `reply_markup` /\n`clear_draft` / `timeout_ms`。"},"711":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"和 `Simplify` 的其它方法一样，**等到结果才返回**（详见调用 TDLib）："},"712":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                         | 发出的 `@type`   | 等到什么               | 返回                                                    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::send_rich_message(chat_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `sendMessage` | 响应 + 发送结局（成功 / 失败） | 最终 `Message`（⚠️ **阻塞**，回调里用 `send_rich_message_then`） |","table":"table-1"},"713":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                                     | 发出的 `@type`       | 等到什么 | 返回                                           |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::edit_rich_message(chat_id, message_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `editMessageText` | 响应   | 改完的 `Message`（回调里用 `edit_rich_message_then`） |","table":"table-1"},"714":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"最常用的两条捷径："},"715":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮在 Markdown 里**没有语法**，一律显式构造：`RichButton::url / callback / user / copy_text`\n（`.style(RichButtonStyle)` 换样式），用 `with_buttons` / `with_button_row` 追加\n`inputPageBlockButtonRow`。"},"716":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"`with_buttons` 只对 **Blocks 源**成立——`server_markdown` / `server_html` 的按钮要用\n服务端语法自己写进文本，对它们调 `with_buttons` 会报 `RichSourceNotBlocks`。"},"717":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"块里的行内内容是独立的 `RichText`（31 个构造器，没有 offset/length）：\nMarkdown 语法能覆盖 21 个，剩下 10 个（`mention` / `hashtag` / `cashtag` /\n`bankCardNumber` / `tonAddress` / `botCommand` / `icon` / `button` / `diff` / `anchor`）\n没有 md 写法，用 `richtext::*` 拼好塞进块（配合 `with_block`）。"},"718":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"`InputPageBlock` 一共 24 个构造器，本地转换器**全都能产出**（`thinking` 只能出现在草稿消息里，\n结构上仍可构造）；`with_block` 也留给「媒体已上传、要传 `inputPhoto` 句柄」这类 md 表达不了的场景。"},"719":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"块级语法**一类一例**：`block_syntax_covers_the_official_table`（每块都再走一遍\n`td_api::InputPageBlock` 反序列化）；整段全格式回归闸是内联的 `official_sample_fully_deserializes`。"},"720":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"加块 / 删块会让 `input_page_block_coverage_is_accounted_for` 失败——24 个构造器的\n分工表就烤在这条测试里。"},"721":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"相关：调用 TDLib（`Simplify` 的其余方法）、插件总览。"},"722":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"page","content":"Rust 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust"},"723":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"fuyubot-plugin-api 与 define_plugin! 的完整写法"},"724":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"依赖"},"725":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"最小可用插件"},"726":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`Plugin` trait"},"727":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"728":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"回调里带状态"},"729":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"编译与安装"},"730":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"Rust 插件只依赖一个 crate：`fuyubot-plugin-api`。它把 `fuyubot-abi` 的形状转成用着不疼的样子——\n`HostApi`（已解包、调用路径上没有 `Option` 和 panic 分支）、`HostExt` 便利方法、\ndrop 即退订的 `Subscription`、`ResponseRouter`（可 `await` 的请求/更新等待），以及\n`define_plugin!` 宏。异步写法见 异步等待。"},"731":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"那个空的 `[workspace]` 不是多余的：没有它，cargo 会一路往上找父目录的 workspace 声明然后报错。"},"732":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"这就是 `fuyubot-sdk init demo --lang rust` 生成的模板："},"733":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                   | 对应符号          | 说明                   |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------- | -------------------- |\n| `init(host) -> Result<Self, String>` | `plugin_init` | 构造状态；返回 `Err` = 加载失败 |","table":"table-0"},"734":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                                    | 对应符号           | 说明                              |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `start(&mut self, config_json) -> Result<(), String>` | `plugin_start` | 宿主已把 VTable、插件目录都准备好；订阅/注册都写在这里 |","table":"table-0"},"735":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                | 对应符号          | 说明                   |\n| ----------------- | ------------- | -------------------- |\n| `stop(&mut self)` | `plugin_stop` | 可选；宏随后把状态收回 `Box` 释放 |","table":"table-0"},"736":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`define_plugin!` 还会把插件代码包在 `catch_unwind` 里——和 `C-unwind` 是两层，\n**两层都要**：一层防 panic 逃出 ABI，一层防 panic 把宿主线程带走。"},"737":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"每个插件在 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下有自己的一段配置（详见配置文件）。\n`HostApi` 上两个方法直接读写它："},"738":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                           | 作用                                                                               |\n| -------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `get_config(section, key) -> Option<String>` | 读**任意**段。`section` 空串读顶层（`[bot]` 等），`key` 空串读整段、否则按点路径取键。返回 JSON 文本，找不到就是 `None` |","table":"table-1"},"739":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                                    | 作用                                                                                    |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `set_config(key, value_json) -> Result<(), AbiError>` | 写**自己**的段。**没有 section 参数**——宿主按调用者身份判定，写不到别人那段。`key` 空串覆盖整段。成功后写内存并回写 `fuyubot.toml` |","table":"table-1"},"740":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"`set_config` 回写是**全量重写** `fuyubot.toml`——你手写在文件里的注释、空行会被 `toml`\n序列化丢掉。插件写配置属于程序化修改，这是可接受的取舍；要保注释就别让插件运行时去改，\n把值手工维护进文件。"},"741":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"回调是裸函数指针，没有捕获环境。状态要么放插件字段、经 `user_data` 传进去，要么像\n`examples/rust-echo` 那样把 `Box<HostApi>` 的地址当 `user_data`："},"742":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"`stop` 里用 `Box::from_raw` 收回，只收一次；否则就是内存泄漏（或重复释放）。"},"743":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"`Subscription` 是 `#[must_use]`：`let _ = host.subscribe_json(…)` 会**立刻退订**。\n一定要存进插件字段。插件卸载时宿主还会整批回滚，但那时插件自己的状态已经漏了。"},"744":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"`define_plugin!` **一个 crate 只能展开一次**。一个 cdylib 就是一个插件——这不是限制，是设计：\n四个导出符号名由 ABI 定死，展开两次就是重复定义。"},"745":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"要发消息、调 TDLib、等响应，见 调用 TDLib；要按字段过滤更新，见\n订阅与事件；契约本身见 ABI 契约。"},"746":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"page","content":"脚本插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts"},"747":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts","content":"一个目录就是一个插件：Python / JS / TS 写逻辑，装上就跑"},"748":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#三步上手","content":"三步上手"},"749":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#1-建目录写两行","content":"1. 建目录、写两行"},"750":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#2-装进机器人","content":"2. 装进机器人"},"751":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#3-跑起来","content":"3. 跑起来"},"752":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"薄 SDK 能干什么"},"753":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"装好之后会发生什么"},"754":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"两种形态怎么选"},"755":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"756":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts","content":"这一页讲**脚本插件**：不编译、不碰 C ABI，用 Python 或 JS / TS 写一个目录，装进机器人就能跑。"},"757":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts","content":"装好之后大概是这样——每个脚本是自己的小进程，坏一个不连累别人："},"758":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#1-建目录写两行","content":"Python 插件的 `pyproject.toml` 里写一段身份（`name` 是插件名，`entry` 不写就默认 `main.py`）："},"759":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#1-建目录写两行","content":"JS / TS 插件写在 `package.json` 里（`entry` 不写就默认 `index.ts`）："},"760":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#1-建目录写两行","content":"入口文件用薄 SDK 写逻辑。Python 长这样："},"761":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#1-建目录写两行","content":"TypeScript 长这样："},"762":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#1-建目录写两行","content":"薄 SDK 是**一个文件**：Python 拷 `fuyubot.py`、TS 拷 `fuyubot.ts` 进插件目录即可\n（随 FuyuBot-SDK 提供，在\n`crates/fuyubot-sdk-native/` 下）。"},"763":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#2-装进机器人","content":"整个目录被复制到 `plugins/scripts/` 下。想确认装好了："},"764":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#3-跑起来","content":"剩下的交给机器人：装依赖（Python 用 `uv sync`，JS / TS 用 `bun install`）、启动脚本、\n开始收事件。流程大致是这样："},"765":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"| 函数              | 干什么                |\n| --------------- | ------------------ |\n| `on(事件名, 处理函数)` | 订阅一个事件，来消息时你的函数被调用 |","table":"table-0"},"766":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"| 函数                    | 干什么                     |\n| --------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `invoke(方法, 参数, 回调?)` | 调一次 TDLib 接口（发消息、取资料……） |","table":"table-0"},"767":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"| 函数             | 干什么                                        |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `log(消息, 级别?)` | 打日志，级别：error / warn / info / debug / trace |","table":"table-0"},"768":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"| 函数               | 干什么      |\n| ---------------- | -------- |\n| `emit(事件名, 数据?)` | 发一条自己的事件 |","table":"table-0"},"769":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"| 函数                                           | 干什么                   |\n| -------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `register_tool(...)` / `use_middleware(...)` | 注册工具、挂中间件（进阶，见下文按语言页） |","table":"table-0"},"770":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"| 函数      | 干什么                  |\n| ------- | -------------------- |\n| `run()` | 握手并开始收事件。**永远放最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"771":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"`on` 收到的 `payload` 是解析好的对象 / 字典，直接取字段就行，不用自己拼 JSON。\n更多事件名与接口用法见按语言的页面："},"772":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"<Card title=\"Python 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/python/\" />"},"773":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"<Card title=\"JS 与 TypeScript 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/js-ts/\" />"},"774":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#薄-sdk-能干什么","content":"<Card title=\"订阅与事件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/events/\" />"},"775":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                           | 机器人的反应                                  |\n| ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin install <目录>` | 目录整个拷进 `plugins/scripts/`，下次 `run` 自动加载 |","table":"table-1"},"776":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                            | 机器人的反应          |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------- |\n| 运行中往 `plugins/scripts/` 丢一个新目录 | 约一秒内自动发现、装依赖、启动 |","table":"table-1"},"777":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的         | 机器人的反应              |\n| ----------- | ------------------- |\n| 运行中删掉一个脚本目录 | 自动停掉对应脚本（对跑着的实例也安全） |","table":"table-1"},"778":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的      | 机器人的反应              |\n| -------- | ------------------- |\n| 改了脚本里的代码 | **不**自动重启；改完重启机器人即可 |","table":"table-1"},"779":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"| 你做的                              | 机器人的反应    |\n| -------------------------------- | --------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin uninstall <目录名>` | 删掉目录并卸载脚本 |","table":"table-1"},"780":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#装好之后会发生什么","content":"**名字的两副面孔**：manifest 里的 `name`（如 `mybot.my-plugin`）是插件身份，日志里看到的是它；\n`plugin uninstall` 用的是**目录名**（`my-plugin`）。装的时候整个目录一起拷，\n`node_modules` / `.venv` / `target` 这类依赖与构建产物会被跳过——到机器人上现装。"},"781":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|     | 脚本插件（本页）            | 原生插件                   |\n| --- | ------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 写什么 | Python / JS / TS 脚本 | Rust / C / C++ 编译出的动态库 |","table":"table-2"},"782":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|      | 脚本插件（本页） | 原生插件        |\n| ---- | -------- | ----------- |\n| 要编译吗 | 不要       | 要（用你自己的工具链） |","table":"table-2"},"783":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|       | 脚本插件（本页）          | 原生插件     |\n| ----- | ----------------- | -------- |\n| 崩了会怎样 | 只有这个脚本的进程死，机器人照常跑 | 可能拖垮整个宿主 |","table":"table-2"},"784":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"|     | 脚本插件（本页）      | 原生插件         |\n| --- | ------------- | ------------ |\n| 适合  | 机器人逻辑、自动化、小工具 | 高性能、要贴近宿主的场合 |","table":"table-2"},"785":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#两种形态怎么选","content":"原生插件是「一个 cdylib 一个插件」，见 插件总览。"},"786":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**脚本报「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」**：脚本进程要加载 `fuyubot_sdk_native`\n（和托管插件是同一份库）。把它放在插件目录里，或设环境变量\n`FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` 指向它的完整路径，再重启机器人。"},"787":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**依赖工具**：Python 要装 uv，JS / TS 要装\nbun。缺了的话对应脚本起不来，日志里会有提示，但不影响机器人启动。"},"788":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**托管插件**：`plugins/` 里要有 `fuyubot_python_host` / `fuyubot_js_host`\n两个中间插件（脚本由它们托管），和内置插件放在一起。"},"789":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**插件名只允许**字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`。"},"790":{"id":"/docs/plugin/scripts-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/scripts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/scripts#常见问题","content":"**想排查脚本**：把配置里 `[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`（见\n配置文件），日志会详细很多。"},"791":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"page","content":"Simplify 封装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify"},"792":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify","content":"fuyubot-simplify 的 API 参考：按功能范围分组的参数结构体、链式设置器与返回值"},"793":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#1-文本内容text-与-parsemode","content":"1. 文本内容：`Text` 与 `ParseMode`"},"794":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#2-发送sendmessageparams","content":"2. 发送：`SendMessageParams`"},"795":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#话题topic","content":"话题：`Topic`"},"796":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#3-媒体media--inputfile--thumbnail","content":"3. 媒体：`Media` / `InputFile` / `Thumbnail`"},"797":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#4-相册sendalbumparams","content":"4. 相册：`SendAlbumParams`"},"798":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"5. 编辑、删除与应答"},"799":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#6-内联键盘replybutton","content":"6. 内联键盘：`ReplyButton`"},"800":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"7. 命令与输入"},"801":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"8. 等待与订阅"},"802":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-10","